<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Mbugu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mburi Kulho sakigi igondiwe ni Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">MBURI KULHO SA KIGI IGONDIWE NI</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOHANA</para>
  <para style="imt">CHIKAEYE</para>
  <para style="ip">Mburi Kulho sa kigi igondiwe ni Yohana ya kitabu chiaha hawe nahu vitabu vikai viaha he Iaghano ikuale viyoiya mifufuire yakwe Yesu Masia. Kira kiwe heka vitabu vihai chisewa Injili kiome chiba, “Mburi Kulho.” Ya vitabu vyeegondiwe to he kigame chakwe Yesu. Vegondie ya vitabu ni Matayo ni Mariko ni Luka ne Yohana. Mburi Kulho sakigi igondiwe ni Yohona yeegondiwe miko ya mikhado kenda Yesu areakhoika. Neri ite kitabu techiyoiya ite Yohana niu echigondie, mira migondire kuu itoe nahu iaha he barua ya bosi, na yakanu na ya kakai yakwe Yohana. Vazagonda vakuwe va azeto vemyoiya Yohana ite eekuzokho he muang'a wa Efeso heka madamo, kwato chimuruika ite ya kitabu cheegondiiwe he muang'a wa Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohana etayo neri kumatu ite chiroe ya kitabu chigondwe ite chivalhaari vahe vamuru kudarisha ite Yesu niu Masia, Muinyi wa Kiumbi efufu, 20:31. Kwakudarisha to tutakhwa vazime kutakhoiya ilhe kuu. Ya kitabu cheegondiwe kwa mburi ya Vayahudi nahu vesivayahudi. Mburi Kulho yakwe Yohana teitoe nahu Mburi Kulho hali kai. Yohana eesaishe kuyoiya hu vimako Yesu eboie, naho tegondie makumure kuli hehu mitotire Yesu egue. Mburi hali sahu Yesu kubatijwa na kugaliwa are roro teegondiwe ii heya Mburi Kulho.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yeaha za:</para>
  <para style="io">Yohana etalholhoshi Mburi Kulho he luhige lwa 1:1-18.</para>
  <para style="io">Naho etagonda mburi ya vimako kuwe Yesu eboie, 1:19-12:50.</para>
  <para style="io">Ekufi ata etayoiya mburi hali jiaha he mifufuire yakwe Yesu yegera kigame kuu na kuka kuli he kigame 13:1-20:31.</para>
  <para style="io">Yohana etafiriti Mburi Kulho he luhige lwa 21 ekuyoia madamo yo Yesu eevaliie vahe areaka kuli he kigame naho Yohana etayoiya chiroe agonde ya kitabu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Kiome ekakhwa Muhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Ata azeto idi lisinaboiwa, Kiome eereaha, ka Kiome eaha hawe ne Kiumbi, naka Kiome nee u Kiumbi. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Kuli azeto na azeto Kiome eeaha hawe ne Kiumbi. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Kiumbi eboie kira kigi kutakhoia Kiome, kira kiwe chiboike kutakhoia heu . <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Heka Kiome heelo uzime, naka uzime niu ugerie luatame he vahe. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Ka luatame, lumurika he kidughu, naho ka kidughu techimurue kugaa ka luatame. <verse eid="JHN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Heelo muhe esughawe kuli he Kiumbi, ilhe kuu esewa Yohana, <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />u eelitie kuvabaia vahe hucho eakhoe mburi yaka luatame, kalo vahe vakhabuna vako na kumdarisha ka luatame kutakhoia he Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Yohana seeka luatame, mira eelitie bi kuvabaiya vahe vyo eviilie heka luatame. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Ya niu luatame lwa kweri elitie he Idi, emurikia kira muhe . <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Ka Kiome ereaha he idi, naho Kiumbi eeboie idi kutakhoia Kiome, mira idi telimuilie. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Eelitie he muan'ga kuu, naho vahe kuu tevemdorie. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Mira vahe vakhabuna vemdorie na kumdarisha, ekavao lumuruisho lwa kukhwa vainyi va Kiumbi. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Ya tevekhwae vainyi kwa kuahowe ni muhe, kwa kudumu na kutoti kwa muhe, mira kutakhoiya Kiumbi salaghuu. <verse eid="JHN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Kiome nau ekasawe sa muhe, ekafufu na nne. Tukauakho ugiru kuu, ugiru sa wa Muinyi salaghe eliye he Aba, ehuye uukulho wa Kiumbi na ukweri. <verse eid="JHN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yohana ekavabaiya vahe huyo eilie kwa mburi yaka Kiome, ekayoisha ekaba, “Ya niu neemyoe to nireba, helitie muhe mgiru kunitakho ani, kwaite u eereaha nisina akhoika.” <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Kwa ukumure wa ukulho wa Kiumbi elo nau nne vakhabuna twaadoria makulho ya Kiumbi naho na makulho ya Kiumbi. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Kiumbi eeguye miku kutakhoya Musa mira ukulho wa Kiumbi na kweri vilitiye kutakhoya Yesu Kiristo. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Tehelo neri muhe eilie kumuakho Kiumbi kwa maila. Mira Muinyi bi eaha sina ne Aba niu etuboiye tumuile Aba.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohana Mzabatija etayo hucho eakhoe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mariko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Muaze muwe madilao va Vayahudi veeaha are Yerusalemu veevasughae vagiru va muaresi vakuwe na Valawi vamlhasu Yohana “Ho ari uji?” <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yohana telhiye kuvakheriti mira evabaie neri kumatu, ekaba “Si ani Kiristo eloijwe ni Kiumbi”. <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />navo vekamlhasu, “Kwato iji ari nij? Hile ni ari Eliya?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:21">Yohana ekakaa muo ekaba “Hai, ani siu”.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:21">Vekamlhasu, “Hile ari u Mroto wa Kiumbi?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:21">U ekavaba, “Hai siu ani!”<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Niho vekamba, “Tubaie ari uji, tudumu utubaiye, turevabaya hu vetusughae. Ho, ari ukuyoiya kimomo salaghe?” <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yohana ekavabaya kutakhoya magondo yakwe Mroto Isaya wakwe Kiumbi, ekuba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">“Ani ni Kiome cha muhe ebirikira he ilangwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">Ikuuruni kwalhi yakwe Dilao!”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Ka vahe veesughawe ni Mafarisayo, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />vekamlhasu Yohana “Kai ari sihu Masia elhoijwe ni Kiumbi hile Eliya hile mroto wa Kiumbi, kwakhoni iji ubatija?” <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yohana ekavaba “Ani nibatija kwa mai, mirao he kune helo muwe musimuiliye. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />U enelita kalufunda mira ani siye neri kuge mulhu ja makwadoe kuu.” <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Ya mburi khabuna yeboike are he muang'a usewa Betania, bwa wa kanu wa mharaza wa Yorodani hodi Yohana eekubatijia.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu niu Kulele alu ya Kiumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Lhenu kuu Yohana ekamuaho Yesu ekumlitia ekaba “Wesia Kulele alu ya Kiumbi edori makusa ya idi! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Ya niu muhe neekuyoya nikuba helo elitiye mzungure gho, mira ni mgiru kunitakho ani ake eereaha ani nisinaba. <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Ani salaghe seemuilie, mira chiroe neekubatija kwa mai niite vahe va Iziraeli vamuakho. <verse eid="JHN 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Yohana ekayo hucho eakhoe ekaba, neemuakhoe Saa wa Kiumbi ekudimi kuli ana he Kiumbi, sauraba ni sua, ekadimi naho ekazokhodi hawe nau ana he msa wakwe Yesu.” <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Ani semuilie, mira Kiumbi enisughaye nibatije vahe kwa mai eenibae, “Muhe unemuakho edimiwa ni Saa Mnyakhare nakuzokho hawe nau, ka niu ebatija kwa Saa Mnyakare.” <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Yohana ekaba, “Ani naakho ya mburi naho nimubaya ite ya ni Muinyi wa Kiumbi.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vahina va bosi vakwe Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Muaze wa kanu, Yohana eeumaye kahali wato oto hawe na vahina kuu vanu. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Yohana areamuakho Yesu ekutakho to, ekaba “Huye niu Kulele alu yakwe Kiumbi” <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Hu vahina vanu vereamko Yohana eyo ya mburi, vekaka vekamlhiaha Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu ekakherii, ekavaakho ka vahina vekumliaha, ekavalhasu “Mudumu kiahoni?” Vekamba “ Rabi, niu Mhinya, udie le?” <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Yesu ekavaba, “Litani, muneakho hodi nidie” Hu vahina vekamliaha, vekaakho hodi eedie, vekalhaha nau heka muaze kwaite nee kela ikado chamagheri. <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Andrea mbakhu wakwe Simoni Petro nee muwe wahu vahina vanu vemkoye Yohana ekuyo to navo vekamliaha Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Andrea, mgitutu kuu wakwe Simoni Petro ekamdaa mbakhu kuu areamuakho ekamba, “Twaamheia Masia” esewa “Kiristo”. <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Andrea ekamtii Simoni hodi Yesu eaha. Yesu ekamuwesia Simoni ekaba, “Ari niu Simoni muinyi wakwe Yohana iji tukasewe kahali Simoni, unesewa Kefa,” sakuba ighamba.<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavalhoja Filipo ne Natanaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Lhenu kuu Yesu ekadumu kuso Galilaya. Ekamheia Filipo, ekamba “Niliahe.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Kwato Filipo eedie are he muang'a wa Betisaida, hodi vedie Andrea ne Petro. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filipo aremuheia Natanaeli, ekamba, “Twamheia hu egondiwe ni Musa he vitabu vya miku na varoto va Kiumbi, niu Yesu muinyi wakwe Josefu muhe edie Nazareti.” <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanaeli ekamlhasu, “Ho kigi kikulho neri kiwe chimuru kuli Nazareti?” Filipo ekamba “Lita uwesie”. <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Yesu areamuakho Natanaeli elita hodi eaha, ekayo mburi kuu ekaba, “Wesia ya ni Muizrael kweri, tehelo lame heu!” <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanaeli ekamlhasu Yesu, “Ho uniilie kimomo?” Yesu ekamba “To Filipo esinakuse, neekuakhoe uaha di he mkhatu wa mtini.” <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Natanaeli ekamba Yesu, “Mhinya, ari u Muinyi wa Kiumbi, ari u Dilao wa Iziraeli”. <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu ekamba, “Udarisha kwaite nakuba ite neekuakhoe di he mkhatu wa mtini? Uneakho mburi giru kutakho ya.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Ekavaba, “Kweri namuba, muneakho maluhige ya are ana he Kiumbi elhaika, naka vazasughawe va are ana he Kiumbi vekukutu na kudimi, hodi eaha Muinyi wa Muhe.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Elha ya kudori are Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Muaze wa kakai heelo elha ya kudori he muang'a wa Kana uaha he idi la Galilaya. Alhii Yesu nau eereaha are. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Yesu hawe na vahina kuu navo veerarikwe heka elha. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Divai ireavakhitia, alhii Yesu ekamba muinyi kuu, “Vaakhitiwa ni divai.” <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesu ekamba, “Lage, ya mburi si kanu, wai si muaze wa kuaija lumuruisho gho.” <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Alhii Yesu, ekavaba vazasughawe va are ana veeaha to, “Cho enemubaiya muboi boini.” <verse eid="JHN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Ata heelo madondo sita eboiiwe na masaheru, kira idondo leekubuu sange koi hile sita ja mai. Yekeiwe ata kwaite veekuraonhia kira muaze sakigi miku kini ya kuaresi idumu. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu ekavaba hu vanyamalo, “Hutini ka madondo mai.” Vekahuti ka madondo sari yekahu. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Niho ekavaba hu vazasughawe, “Bukuni iji mai mumtiiye mgiru wa elha.” Vekamtiia ka mai, <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />hu mgiru wa elha areagali ka mai ekaaho yaakhwa divai. Teeiliye ite ka divai ilie nale, mira hu vanyamalo vebukhue hu mai veeilie. Niho mgiru wa elha ekamse hu mzadori khakhera, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />ekamba, “Vahe khabuna vegu ini divai kulho, vagalho varaawaha sari vaengeli vetagera hu divai esikulho. Mira ari ukee hu divai kulho sari waijiji!” <verse eid="JHN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Ya nee kimako cha bosi cho Yesu eboie, eechiboie are he muang'a usewe Kana uaha he idi la Galilaya. Kwato ekaaija lumuruisho, na vahina kuu vekamdarisha. <verse eid="JHN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Ka elha irekhita Yesu ekali hawe ne alhii kuu, vabakhu kuu na vahina kuu vekaso Kapernahumu vekafufu are maaze esimakumure.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etaso he Minda ya Kiumbi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Matayo 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mariko 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luka 19:45-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Elha ya Pasaka ya Vayahudi yeehee sina, Yesu ekaso Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Are he minda ya Kiumbi ekavahelha vahe vedi na kuwe wa na maalu na sua, naho ekavaakho vahe vahali veekupuiyana mihaku kini kalo vakhwa na mihaku yahe minda ya Kiumbi. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Yesu ekaboi ndate ya mulhu, ekavagu vakhabuna vali he minda ya Kiumbi na maalu na wa kini, ekalhuku meza ja hu vahe vekupuiyana mihaku ekasu mihaku kini. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Ekavaba hu vekudidi sua, “Jiguni ii musiboi minda ya Aba gho kukhwa kikhoja!” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Vahina kuu vekahulha ite magondo eba, “Ludumuisho gho he minda kechi lulo u, lukha za gho sa mwalha.” <verse eid="JHN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Vagiru va Vayahudi vekamlhasu, “Ho, umuru kuboi lhaa mina kuaija ite ulo ugiru wa kuboi ya?” <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu ekavaba, “Ipuni ya minda ya Kiumbi, na ani nineikwa kahali kwa maaze makai.” <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Hu vagiru Vayahudi vekamlhasu, “Ya minda ya Kiumbi idorie miko mikado mihai na tizu kukwawe, kwaakhoni iji uba uneikwa kwa maaze makai?” <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Mira Minda ya Kiumbi yo Yesu eekuyoya ni msa kuu salaghe. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Kwato areaka kuli he kigame, vahina kuu vekahulha ite eevabaiye ya mburi, niho vekadarisha magondo na hu mburi Yesu eeyoe.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu eiliye swaho ja vahe vakhabuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Yesu eaha are Jerusalemu he elha ya Pasaka vahe vakumure vekamdarisha vareakho vimako vyo eboiye. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Mira Yesu teevadumuije kwaite eereile vikhabuna viaha he swaho kini. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Teedumue muhe ambaiye mburi ja vahe vakhabuna vetoe kwaite u salaghe ereile viaha he swaho kini.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etavurirwa ni Nikodemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Heelo mgiru muwe he ifyo la Mafarisayo ilhe kuu eekusewa Nikodemo nau nee muwe wa ibaraza igiru la Vayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Kiama kiwe ekali ekaso he Yesu ekamba, “Rabi sa kuba Mhinya tureile ite ari umhinya ulie he Kiumbi. Tehelo muhe emuru kuboi vimako vyo uboi kai Kiumbi teaha hawe nau.” <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu ekamba, “Kweri nitakubaya, tehelo muhe enemuru kukhwa he udilao wa Kiumbi eesisawe kahali.” <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodemo ekamlhasu, “ Imuruikana kimomo muhe mzime!” Ho, muhe emuru kubuu he maso ya lage kini aakhoike kahali? <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu ekamba “Natakubaya Kweri, tehelo muhe emuru kukhwa he Udilo wa Kiumbi eesina kusawe kwa mai na kwa Swaho. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Msa usa msa mira swaho isa swaho. Muhe eakhoke kwa swaho ya Kiumbi etakhwa na uzime wa swaho. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Kwato usimake nikukuba ite udumuwe uakhoike ka kanu. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Saa iso hodi idumu, urako mvumiro kuu mira tuilie ho ili hile ho iso. Niu chitotiye he muhe eeakhowe ni swaho.” <verse eid="JHN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodemo ekamlhasu “Ya mburi jimuruika kimomo?” <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu ekamba, “Ari ni mhinya he idi la Iziraeli ho tuailiye ya makhabuna? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Nitakubaiya kweri ite, nne tuyo huyo tuiliye nakuvabaia huyo tuakhoe nakumubaiya, mira kune temudumu huyo tuakhoe na kukubaiya. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Kai tunidarisha nikukubaiya mburi ja idi, ho unedarisha kimomo nikukubaiya mburi ja are ana he Kiumbi? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Tehelo ekutue kuso ana he Kiumbi saari bi Muinyi wa Muhe bi edimie kuli ana he Kiumbi.” <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Sakigi Musa erengeshe bome ya shaba ana he mkhatu madamo Vaiziraeli veaha are he ilangwa wato oto chidumuwa Muinyi wa Muhe arengeshwe ana he msar aba, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />kalo kira muhe enemdarisha akhwa na uzime wa maaze makhabuna. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Kwaite Kiumbi eevadumue vahe va idi, sari ekamgu Muinyi kuu salaghe, kalo kira muhe emdarisha asilaha mira akhwa na uzime wa maaze makhabuna. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Kwaite Kiumbi temsughae Muinyi kuu avazamari vahe va idi, mira eemsughae Muinyi kuu kuvagu vahe va idi kuli he makusa. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Hu vemdarisha na kumuarira tevepaaiwe zamaro, mira hu vesidarisha vaafi kuzamariwa, kwaite tevemdarishe Muinyi wa Kiumbi salaghe. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Naya niu zamaro, ite luatame lwaalita he vahe va idi, mira vahe vaadumu kidughu vekasanuia luatame, kwaite veboi makusa. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Kwaite hu vakhabuna veboi makusa verasanuia luatame na tevelita he luatame, kwaite tevedumu makusa kini yaahowe. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Mira hu vakhabuna veboi mburi ja kweri velita he luatame kalo huyo veboi yaahoike ite vaaowe umuruisho ni Kiumbi.<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohana mzabatija eyoiya mburi jakwe Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Ka mburi khabuna jireatakho, Yesu na vahina kuu, vekaso he idi la Uyahudi, vekafufu are na kuvabatija vahe. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Yohana nau eekubatija are Ainoni, sina na idi lisewa Salimu, kwaite are heelo mai makumure. Vahe veekumlitia nau ekavabatija. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Ya yeboiike yohana esina lhatiiwa he igereza. <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Muaze muwe vahina vakuwe vakwe Yohana na Myahudi muwe vekatakhoana viome he mburi ya kuonhi kalo uye kumuaresi Kiumbi. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Vekaso he Yohana na kumba “Rabi ite, Mhinya, ho, urahulha hu muhe eeaha twai bwa wa kanu wa mharaza wa Yordani, huye weetubaie mburi jo uilie kuli heu? waijiji ebatija vahe naho kira muhe eso hakuu!” <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yohana ekavaba, “Tehelo mhe emuru kuboi kigi saari akhwa eowe kuli ana he Kiumbi.” <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Kuni salaghe mweekoie nikuba, “Ani siu Kiristo elhoijwe ni Kiumbi, mira nitesughawa nimkaeiye.” <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Mlage edoriwe ni wa mwagiru edori mira msaho wa muagiru edori euma sina na u na kulahonha kuli hakuu. Elhamuishishwa ekuko kiome cha muagiru mzadori. Kwa mburi ya kulhamuiwa gho kwaafuru. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />U edumuwe akhwa mgirusha na ani nikhwa mgitutusha.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hu elita kuli ana he Kiumbi ni mgiru kutakho vakhabuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />U elhoijwe elie ana he Kiumbi ni mgiru kutakho kira muwe, muhe wa idi erayo hu eailie heya idi, mira Yesu elie he Kiumbi niu eumaia makhabuna kira hodi. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />U eratubaia eyaakhoe nakuyako are ana he Kiumbi, mira tehelo edumu huyo eyaakhoe nakuyako <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Mira muhe enedumu hu kigi eyo etaaija ite viome vya Kiumbi nivya kweri. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Hu esughaiwe ni Kiumbi erayo viome vya Kiumbi, kwaite Kiumbi emo Swaho kuu khabuna. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Aba emdumu Muinyi naho aamo vigi vikhabuna vikhwa he miharegha kuu. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Emdarisha Muinyi elo uzime wa maaze makhabuna, mira hu emlhi Muinyi tekakhwa na uzime wa maaze makhabuna naho malhaha ya Kiumbi enemlitia.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etayo na mlage kuli Samaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Yesu areila ite Mafarisayo vaako ite ebunguru na kubatija vahina vakumure kutakho Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Ukweri niite Yesu salaghe siu eekubatija, mira vahina kuu neevo veekubatija. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Kwato Yesu na vahina kuu vekali he idi la Yudea vekakirii Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Mira he bari kuu eekudumuwe atakhoie Samaria. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Ekahe hodi hesewa Sikari he muang'a wa Samaria, ata nee sina nahu mbuva yo Yakobo emuoye muinyi kuu Josefu. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Kisima chakwe Yakobo cheaha ata. Yesu nau eekwahie kwa bari, kwato ekazokhodi sina nahu kisima. Madamo ka nee chakako kaaze keekukhaisha. <verse eid="JHN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Niho mlage muwe kuli Samaria ekaso kurabukhu mai, Yesu ekamba, “Nio mai niwaha.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Madamo ka vahina kuu veesoye he muang'a kurawe viaghu. <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Hu mlage Msamaria ekamba ari , “Chimuruika kimomo ari u Myahudi na ani ni Msamaria kwaakhoni utanilhawa mai?” Eembaie to kwaite Vayahudi teveekuboi vigi kini hawe na Vasamaria. <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu ekamba, “Kai uteila kitumulilo cho Kiumbi eseekuo, na kuila ite niji ekuba nio mai niwaha, waari wesemlhawa akuo mai enekuboi ukhwa na uzime.” <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Hu mlage ekamba Yesu, “Dilao ya kisima nkikulhe mira tulo neri kikholhe chakubukhuia mai kuli he kisima. Ka mai ya uzime uyagu nale? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Tuba ari umgiru kumtakho kaka mkanu Yakobo etuoe ya kisima? Yakobo salaghe na vamilo kuu hawe na wa kuu veekubukhu na kuwaha mai yaya kisima.” <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu ekamba, kira ewaha mai kuli heya kisima enekhwa na kasu kahali. <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Mira vakhabu na venewaha mai ninevao ani, tevekakhwa na kasu neri. Mai ninevao ani inekhwa shoko inevao uzime usikhita. <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Hu mlage ekamba, “Dilao nio ka mai niwaha kalo nisikhwa na kasu kahali, naho nisilita kahali kubukhu mai ii!” <verse eid="JHN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu ekamba, “So uremse muagiru kechi, ulite nau ii.” <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Ka mlage ekamba “Ani silo muagiru.” Yesu ekamba “Wayo kweri, ite tulo muagiru. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Kwaite weelo vaagiru vakoi, naka udie nau waijiji simuagiru kechi. Ata wayo kweri.” <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Ka mlage ekamba, “Dilao niakho ite ari umroto wa Kiumbi. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Vakaka kanu vearesie heya lubwa, mira kune muba ite hodi hakumuaresia Kiumbi ni twai Yerusalemu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu ekambaya hu mlage, “Nidarisha ani, madamo elitie munemuaresi Aba mira si ii heya lubwa, neri twai Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Kune vahe Vasamaria mumuaresi hu msimuilie, mira nne Vayahudi tumuaresi Kiumbi tumuiliye, kwaite lukombo lulie he Vayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Mira madamo elitie, naho yaahe, hu vaaresi va kweri, venemuaresi Aba kuli he swaho ilai vekuuma he kweri. Kwaite Aba evadaa vahe saya vamuaresi. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Kiumbi ni Saa, na vahe vakhabuna vemuaresi vedumuwa vamuaresi kuli he Swaho na kuuma he kweri.” <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Ka mlage ekamba, “Nireila ite Kiristo elhoijwe ni Kiumbi elitie.” Niu Kiristo elhoijwe ni Kiumbi. U ekuralita enetubaia mburi khabuna. <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu ekamba, “Ani niyo naari, niu Masia elhoijwe ni Kiumbi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Madamo waka aka vahina kuu vekakirii, vekamaka kumuakho ekuyo na mlage. Mira tehelo muhe embaye, “Udumu kiakhoni heya mlage? Hile emlhasue, Kwaakhoni uyo nau?” <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Ka mlage ekaro sange kuu to, ekaso he muang'a kuravabaia vahe, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Litani mremuakho muhe enibaiye mburi khabuna jo niboie! Hile, imuru kukhwa niu Masia elhoijwe ni Kiumbi?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Kwato vahe vekali he muang'a, vekaso hodi Yesu eaha. <verse eid="JHN 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Madamo waka aka vahina kuu veekumgogo, “Mhinya a viaghu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Mira Yesu ekavaba, “Ani nilo viaghu vyo kune musiviilie.” <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Niho vahina kuu vekalhasuana, “Hile, helo muhe emgerie viaghu?” <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesu ekavaba, “Viaghu gho ni kuboi hucho Kiumbi edumu na kuifiriti nyamalo kuu enisughae.” <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Kune muba, “Imerisie milhihe mihai bi kuhe madamo ya kuloja.” Mira ani nimubao, “Wesiani vahe cho veliti he ani vetoe sa mbeyu jiaha sina kulojwa.” <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Mzaloja eralhanuwa, nau enebunguru ulojo naka ulojo ni vahe velaa uzime wa maaze khabuna, kwato elhae nahu elojie velhamuiwa hawe. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Kwato ya kiome chiba “Muwe elha mbeyu mhali eloja, ni kwerisha.” <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Ani neemusughae mureloja ulojo wo musilhae, vahali veeuboie nyamalo ure, mira kune mulhanuwa kuli he nyamalo kini.<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Vasamaria vakumure hehu muang'a veemdarishe Yesu kwaite hu mlage eevabae “Ya muhe aanibaiya kira kigi neeboiye.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Kwato hu Vasamaria vemliahe vekamgogo afufu hakini, Yesu nau ekafufu navo miaze minu. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Madamo ka vahe vakumuresha vekamdarisha Yesu kwa mburi ya viome kuu. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Niho vekamba ka mlage, “Waijiji tudarisha mira si kwa viome kechi bi utubaie, mira nikwaite twaamko nne salaghe, naho tureile ite niu Mzakaa idi he kharo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etamuuti muinyi wa dilao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Hu maaze manu areatakho Yesu ekali ata Samaria, ekaso Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Yesu salaghe eeyoe ite, “Mroto wa Kiumbi tekoiwa he muang'a kuu salaghe.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Kwato areahe Galilaya, vahe vakumure vekamdoria. Kwaite navo veereaha he elha ya Pasaka naho veeakhoe mburi khabuna Yesu eejiboiye are Yerusalemu madamo yaka elha. <verse eid="JHN 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Yesu ekahe kahali are he muang'a usewa Kana, are Galilaya, hodi eekheritie mai ikakhwa divai. Are heelo dilao muwe elo muinyi kuu mrukhao are Kapernaumu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Ka dilao areakoia ite Yesu elie Yudea nakulita Galilaya, kwato ekaso hodi eaha ekamlhawa aso nau Kaperanaumu kalo aremuuti muinyi kuu eeaha sina na kuga. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesu ekamba, “Kune vahe mukusaakho lhaa na vimako neri temudarisha.” <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Ka dilao ekamba “Dilao tuso hawe, muinyi gho esinaga.” <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu ekamba, “Sobi, muinyi kechi aau pere.” Ka muhe ekadarisha viome vyakwe Yesu, ekalholhoshi kukhwaa ang'a. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Areakhwa echeri aha kwalhi, vanyamalo kuu vekamdaria vekamba, muinyi kechi ni mzime. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Hu dilao ekavalhasu mburatu gho eue madamo mina? vekamba “Osa kela saba ha chakhakho, ihoma likamro.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Ka dilao ekahulha ite ni wahuhu madamo Yesu embaiye, “Muinyi kechi eneu.” Ata u na vahe kuu vakhabuna edie navo vekamdarisha Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Ya ni kimako cha kanu Yesu eeboiye arehe Galilaya areali Yudea.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etamuuti esimuru kudaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Yesu arefi kuboi kayo are Kana, ekaso Yerusalemu he elha ya Vayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Are Yerusalemu, Sina na luhige lusewa luhige lwa ialu, helo iziwa kwa Kiebrania lisewa Betizata, leejungulukwe ni malukumbi makoi. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Ata he malukumbi heelo varukhao vakumure vezokhodie na vegae maila na vesimuru kudaha na veeholoje vekulaa mai yakuchuwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Kwaite heelo madamo mzasughawe wa Kiumbi eekudimi, ekukuchu hu mai, mai ikufi kukuchuwa hu enekhwa wabosi kubuu, etautiwa kira urukhao wo elo nawo. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Ata heelo muhe muwe eekuru kwa miko salasini na mnane. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesu eremuakho ka mrukhao ebodie, ekaile ite ka muhe eerue kwa madamo makumure, ekamlhasu, “Ho, udumu kuutiwe?” <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Ka mrukao ekaba, “Dilao, ani silo muhe enibutu he iziwa madamo ekukuchwa, nikugali bi kubuu, muhe mhali etanikaeia nakumangabuu he kisima.” <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesu ekamba, “Ka uuma, udori inagho kechi uso.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Wa ata ata hu muhe ekau niho ekauma, ekadori inagho kuu ekadaha. Ya mburi yeboike Muaze wa kusaaboi nyamalo. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Kwato vagiru va Vayahudi vekamba ka muhe eutiiwe, “Wai ni Muaze wa kusaaboi nyamalo, miku teikudumuija ari kutii inagho kechi.” <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Mira u ekavaba, “Hu muhe eniutie niu enibaye, dori inagho kechi, uso.” <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Vekamlhasu, “ Ho, niji ekubae dori inagho kechi uso?” <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Mira ka muhe eeutiwe teemuilie Yesu, kwaite Yesu eebuuye he ifyo la vahe vakumure. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Iji, kalufunda Yesu ekamheia hu muhe emuutie he minda ya Kiumbi ekamba, “Iji waautiwe, usiboi makusa kahali, kalo usedarawe ni mburi kusa kuro huyo weelo nayo.” <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Ka muhe ekaso, ekavabaiya vagiru va Vayahudi ite Yesu niu emutiie. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Kwaite Yesu eboiye ka mburi Muaze wa kusaaboi nyamalo, Vayahudi vekalholhoshi kumnyamarisha Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Yesu ekavaba, “Aba gho eboi nyamalo maaze makhabuna, na ani nidumuwa niboi nyamalo.” <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Kwaka viome Yesu eyoe, vagiru va Vayahudi vekagali kudaa kwalhi yakumgaa Yesu, sikuoni bi miku ya Muaze wa kusaaboi nyamalo, mira ni hawe na kuba ite Kiumbi ni Abaghe, kwato aakuaghati ne Kiumbi.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Udilao wa Muinyi wa Kiumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu ekavaba “Nimubaya kweri, Muinyi temuru kuboi mburi sakigi edumu u mira eboi bi huyo eakho Abaghe ekuboi.” Kira chiboiwa ni Abaghe na Muinyi etaboi wato oto. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Kwaite aba emdumue Muinyi, nau emuaija hu makhabuna yo eboi nau enemuaija nyamalo girusha ja kuboi kutakho ya, kalo nakune mumakishwe nijo. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Sa kigi Aba evakaa vahe kuli he kigame nakuvao uzime, wato oto Muinyi nau evao uzime hu vo edumue. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Neri Aba tempaaya muhe zamaro, mira emuoe Muinyi ugiru wa kupaaya vahe vakabuna zamaro, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />kalo vahe vakhabuna vamuru vamko Muinyi sa kigi vemko Abaghe. Esimko Muinyi temko Abaghe emsughaye. <verse eid="JHN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />Nimubaya kweri, kira eko kiome gho na kumdarisha hu enisughaye elo na uzime wa maaze makhabuna. Tepaaiwa zamaro, iji tegae mira ni mzime. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Nimubaya kweri, madamo elitiye, naho yaafi kuhe, vegaye veneko kiome cha Muinyi wa Kiumbi, na ka veneko venekhwa vazime. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Sa kigi Aba niu kulholhoshi kwa uzime, niu kigi emuoe Muinyi kuu kulholhoshi kwa uzime wa maaze makhabuna. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Kahaliwa aamuo Muinyi kuu ugiru wa kupaaya vahe zamaro, kwaite niu muhe wa kweri kuli ana he Kiumbi. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Musimake ya mburi, kwaite madamo elitiye vakhabuna veaha za he mbira veneko kiome kuu, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />vakhabuna veneli za he mbira kini, ka veboiye makulho veneka kuli he kigame nakuowe uzime wa maaze makhabuna, nahu veboiye makusa veneka kuli he kigame nakuzamariwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vemuahoye Yesu kwa maila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Ani simuru kuboi mburi sakigi nidumu, nipaaya zamaro sakigi Kiumbi enibaiya, kwato zamaro gho nija kweri kwaite siboi sakigi nidumu, mira niboi sahu kigi hu enisughaye edumu. <verse eid="JHN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Kai niteyo yoniilie salaghe yo niyo teyesekhwae ya ukweri. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Mira helo mhali eyo mburi ejiilie he ani, yeaji ite yoniyayo niya kweri, na ani nireile ite viome kuu nivya kweri. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Mweesughaye vahe he Yohana, nau ekayo mburi ja kweri eilie he ani. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Ani sidumu kuilikana kutakhoia he vahe veyo kuli hagho mira nimubaiya kune mburi jiyoiwe ni Yohana mzabatija kalo muguwe kuli he kharo. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yohana eetoe sa kijari chika na kugu luatame, na kune mwelhoje kulhamuiwa nika luatame kwa madamo maghere. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Mira ani ninemubaiya mburi girusha jo niakhoe kutakho hu jakwe Yohana, kwaite hu nyamalo jo Aba enioe kalo niboi, jiaija ite aba enisughaye, lhaa ya jiaija ite Aba niu enisughae. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Aba enisughaye u salaghe aaniyoiya ukweri. Kune temuila kukoiya kiome kuu, neri kuakho vubasa kuu, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />neri temudarisha kikulho viome kuu vyo emubaya sacho chidumuwe, kwaite temumdarishe hu esughawe. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Kune muwesia magondo ya Kiumbi kwaite mutoti ite kuli heka magondo muneowe uzime wa maaze makhabuna, mira iji waka ka magondo eniyoiya ani. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Naho wato kune temudumu kulita hodi niaha kalo muakho uzime. <verse eid="JHN 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Ani sidaa kuowa udilao kuli he vahe. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Mira nireile ite kune temulo ludumuisho lwa Kiumbi he swaho kaghu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Ani nilitie kalo niyo sakigi Aba gho edumu nimubaie, mira kune mutalhi, mira muhe mhali ekulita kwa ilhe kuu salaghe, kune munemdoria. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Kune mudumu kuyoiana kikulho salaghe, mira temumuru kudaa kuyoiwa kikulho kuli he Kiumbi salaghe, iji mumuru kimomo kunidarisha ani? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Musitoti ite ninemuyoija he Aba. Musa mumuarira, niu enemuyoija. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Kai kweri mwemdarishe Musa, mwesenidarishe na ani, kwaite Musa eegondie mburi gho. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Mira temudumu hu mburi egondie, munemuru kimomo iji, kudarisha viome niyo?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etavao viaghu vahe erufu koi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mariko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Yesu arefiriti ata ekatakho kuso bwa mhali wa iziwa la Galilaya, kwa ilhe ihali lisewa iziwa Tiberia <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Ifyo igiru la vahe leekumliaha kwaite veakhoe lhaa eekujiboi ja kuvauti varukhao. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Niho Yesu ekakutu he lubwa ekazokhodi hawe na vahina kuu. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Heka maaze elha ya Vayahudi isewa Pasaka ye hee sina. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yesu arewesia ekaakho ifyo la vahe vakumure vemlitia, ekamlhasu Filipo, “Tunewe le mikate kalo ya vahe vaa?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Eelhasue to kwaite ekumgali bi Filipo, kwaite ereila cho eneboi. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filipo ekamba, “Neri vikhao magana manu vya madini ya mihaku teviagha kuweia mikate kalo vahe khabuna vaa.” <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Mhina kuu mhali, mgitutu wakwe Simoni Petro esewa Andrea, ekamba, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Helo mburatu muwe elo mikate mikoi ya shairi na samaki nu, mira ya teviagha neri he vahe vakumure saya.” <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Ata heelo kibanda chilo mahako makumure mahilhe. Yesu ekaba, “Vabani vahe vazokhodi.” Niho ka vahe vekazokhodi, veerahe vaagiru erufu koi. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yesu ekadori hu mikate, ekamuaresi Kiumbi, ekavakhakhaya vahe veezokhodie; ekaboi watoto nahu samaki, kira muhe ekasiki sakigi edumuye. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Vahe vareakhu, Yesu ekavaba vahina kuu, “Dodolini ka vikhao vimerisie, hasilakha neri kiwe.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Niho, vekavibunguru ka vikhao vya mikate ya shayiri vimerisiwe, vekahuija viteju ikado na vinu. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Vahe vereakho ka vimako vyo Yesu eboiye, velholhoshi kuba, “Kweri ya niu mroto wa Kiumbi elitiye he idi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yesu areaila ite vahe vedumuye vamboi akhwa dilao esidumuye u salaghe kwato ekaazaghana ekaso he lubwa salaghe.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etadaha ana he mai</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matayo 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mariko 6:45-52</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Hareakhokwa, vahina vakwe Yesu vekadimi kuso he iziwa, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />vekabuu he mashua kalo vatakho kuso Kafaranaumu. Kidughu cheebuiye, Yesu ekakhwa tenavaheiya. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Iziwa likakhwa na nkunkunho kwaite saa giru ya mai yeekuvumira. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Vahina vareakhwa vesoe na mashua uda urahe kilomita koi hile tizu, vekamuakho Yesu ekudaha ana he mai, naho ekulita sina na mashua, vekabughenusha. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Mira Yesu ekavaba, “Niani musibugheno!” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Niho vekadumu Yesu abuu he mashua kini, waata ata mashua ikahe hodi veekuso.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vahe vetamdaa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Muaze wa kanu ifyo la vahe vakumure veemerisie mlha wakanu wa iziwa veeakhoe mashua we imerisie. Naho veeakhoe ite Yesu teebuie he mashua we na vahina kuu, mira ka vahina niu vesoe salaghini. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Mashua hali kuli Tiberia jikahe sina nato hodi vahe veeaie hu mikate, Dilao arefiritii kumgimbika Kiumbi. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Wato oto ifyo la vahe vareaila ite Yesu na vahina kuu vaahali to hodi, vekabuu he mashua kini vekaso Kaperanaumu varemdaa.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu niu viaghu vya uzime</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Hu vahe varemheia Yesu bwa wakanu wa iziwa vekamlhasu, “Mhinya, uhee ami ii?” <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu ekavaba, “Nitamubaiya ukweri, temunidaa kwa mburi yahu lhaa mujiakhoe nikujiboi, mira munidaa kwaite mweeae mikate mukakhu. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Musinyamarikie viaghu vionika, munyamarike kwa viaghu vinefufu maaze makhabuna. Ka niu viaghu Muinyi enemuo kwaite Kiumbi Aba aaija ite ani niu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Niho navo vekamlhasu, “Ho, tusamo kalo tumuru kujiboi nyamalo ja Kiumbi?” <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu ekavaba, “Ya niu nyamalo Kiumbi edumu muiboi niu ya, kumdarisha hu emsughaye.” <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Vekamba, “Ho, uneboi lhaa mina tujiaho kalo tumuru kukudarisha? Ho, Uneboi kimako mina?” <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Vakaka kanu veeae mana are he ilangwa, sakigi magondo ya Kiumbi eyo, Eevaoe viaghu kuli ana he Kiumbi. <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesu ekavaba, “Kweri nitamubaya, Musa siu emuoe viaghu kuli ana he Kiumbi, mira Aba gho niu emuo viaghu vya kweri kuli ana he Kiumbi. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Kwaite viaghu vya Kiumbi emuo nihu edimi kuli ana he Kiumbi na kuvao vahe va idi uzime wa maaze makhabuna.” <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Vekamba, “Dilao, utuo ka mkate kira muaze.” <verse eid="JHN 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesu ekavaba, “Ani niu viaghu vya uzime. Eneniliaha ani tekakoie kela neri, nahu enidarisha tekakoiye kasu neri. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Kwato neemubaie ite, mwaniaho mira temunidarisha. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Hu vakhabuna Aba enio venelita hagho, neri muhe muwe eneniliaha sikambibi, <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />kwaite nidimiye kuli ana he Kiumbi, silitie kalo nikuboi midumure gho salaghe, mira nilitie kuraboi kigi edumu hu enisughaye. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Hu enisughae edumu niboi to, hehu vahe enioye nisimbibi neri muwe, mira muaze wa mkhito wa idi nivakaa vakhabuna kuli he kigame. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Kwaite kigi Aba edumu niya, kira emuaho Muinyi ekumdarisha akhwa na uzime wa maaze makhabuna. Na ani ninemkaa kuli he kigame he muaze wa mkhito wa idi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Kwato Vayahudi vakuwe vekalholhoshi kumyo, kwaite ebaye, “Ani ni viaghu vidimie kuli ana he Kiumbi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Vekaba, “Ho ya muhe si muinyi wakwe Josefu? Tumuiliye abaghe ne alhii kini. Emuru kimomo kuba, Nidimie kuli ana he Kiumbi?” <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu ekavaba “Roni kung'ung'urikiana.” <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Tehelo muhe emuru kulita hagha, Aba enisughaye ekusaamgera hagho, naho ani ninemkaa ka muhe kuli he kigame muaze wa mkhito wa idi. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Varoto va Kiumbi veegondie ite, “Vahe vakhabuna venehinywa ni Kiumbi.” Kira muhe ekoie na kuhina kuli he Aba, enelita hodi niaha. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Tehelo neri muhe emuakhoe Kiumbi Aba , mira hu bi edimie kuli ana he Kiumbi, ka niu emuahoe Aba. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Nitamubaia ukweri, hu enidarisha enekhwa na uzime usikhita. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Ani niu viaghu vya uzime. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Vakaka kaghu veeae mana he ilangwa, mira vekaga. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Mira ya niu viaghu vilie ana he Kiumbi kalo kira enea asiga. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Ani niu viaghu vya uzime vidimie kuli ana he Kiumbi. Muhe enevia ya viaghu enefufu maaze khabuna. Viaghu ninemuo ni msa gho, niugu kwa mburi ya uzime wa vahe va idi. <verse eid="JHN 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Niho Vayahudi vekalholhoshi kutakhoana viome kwa malhaha, “Ya emuru kimomo kutuo msa kuu, tuua?” <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yesu ekavaba, “Kweri nitamubaia mukusa a msa wa Muinyi wa Muhe na kuwaha sako kuu, temkakhwa na uzime wa maaze makhabuna za kaghu. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Muhe ea msa gho na kuwaha sako gho, elo uzime wa maaze khabuna, kwato ninemkaa kuli he kigame muaze wa mkhito. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Kwaite msa gho ni viaghu vya kweri, na sako gho ni chakuwaha cha kweri. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Ea msa gho na kuwaha sako gho, enezokho za gho, na ani ninezokho za kuu. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Sa kigi Aba enisughaye elo uzime naani nizokho kutakhoia he Aba, nire wato hehu enenia enezokho kwa kwalhi gho <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Ya niu viaghu vilie ana he Kiumbi, tevitotie nahu vakaka kaghu veae navo vekaga. Kira enea ya viaghu tekaga mira enezokho maaze khabuna.” <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesu eeyoe viome ka, to eekuhinya are he minda veekusahea Vayahudi are Kaperanaumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vahina vahali vetaro kumdarisha Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Vahina vakumure vareako to vekaba, “Ya mahinyo ni maure! Niji emuru kuyadoria?” <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yesu eiliye e ite vahina kuu veekung'ung'urika kwa ka mahinyo, ekavalhasu, “Ho, ya mahinyo emuboi muro kunidarisha? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Inekhwa kimomo iji mukumuakho Muinyi wa Muhe ekukutu kuso twai hodi eeaha azeto? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Swaho wa Kiumbi niu egera uzime, msa teumuru kuboi kigi kwa u kuu bi. Viome nimubaie niu viboi mukhwa na Saa wa Kiumbi emuo na uzime. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Mira he kune helo hu vesinidarisha.” Yesu eyoe to kwaite madamo khabuna eilie ite nivaji vesidarisha, kahali niji enemkherii. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Kwato ekaba, “Niu chiro neemubae ite tehelo emuru kulita hagho sari Aba amdumuije.” <verse eid="JHN 6:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Kwa mburi ya, Vahina kuu vakumure vekagawe ni swaho vekaro kumliaha naho tevesoe nau he barime kuu. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Kwato ekavalhasu hu vahina ikado na vanu eevalhoije, “Ho, na kune mudumu kuso?” <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simoni Petro ekamba, “Dilao, tuneso hakweji? Ari ulo viome vituo uzime wa maaze makhabuna. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Nne twaadarisha na kuile ite ari uwa Kiumbi naho usughawe ni Kiumbi” <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesu ekavaba “Ho, seemulhoije kune ikado na vanu? Mira muaro kaghu muwe ni Shetani!” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Yesu eekumyo Yuda, Muinyi wakwe Simoni Isikarioti, kwaite ,neri ite nee muwe wahu vahina ikado vanu mira niu eneramkherii.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etalhi kuso Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Ka mburi jireataho Yesu ekaso hodi hakumure he idi la Galilaya, teedumue kuso hodi ha idi la Yudea kwaite vagiru va Vayahudi veekudaa kwalhi ya kumgaa. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Madamo ka elha ya vuminda vwa Vayahudi yehee sina. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Kwato, vabakhu kuu vekamba, “Hali ii uso Yudea, kalo vahina kechi vaakho vimako uboi. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Tehelo muhe edumu kuilika kwa kuboi mburi kwa kukumatu. Kai uboi ya mburi kuaije he idi.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Vaagitutu kuu veeyoe to kwaite tevekudarisha ite u ni Masia elhoijwe ni Kiumbi. <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yesu ekavaba, “Madamo gho teenaba kuhe, mira kune mumuru kuso are madamo makhabuna. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Vahe va Idi tevemuru kumusanuia kune, mira venisanuia ani kwaite nireila ite miboire kini ni mikusa. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Kune soni heka elha, mira ani sikaso, kwaite madamo gho nidumuwa kuso Yerusalemu teunaba kuhe.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Arefiriti kuyo to ekafufu are Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu he elha ya vuminda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Mira vagitutu kuu vareali kuso he elha, Yesu nau ekaso, mira eesoe kwakukumatu. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Vagiru va Vayahudi veekumdaa ata he elha, veekulhasu, “Ya muhe eaha le?” <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Maifyo makumure ya vahe veekutakhoana viome kwa mburi kuu, vahali vekuba, “Ni muhe mkulho.” Vahali vekalhi, “Hai! Etavata vahe.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Mira tehelo muhe egalie kuyoisha mburi jakwe Yesu neri kumatu kwaite vekuvabugheno vagiru va Vayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Madamo ya maaze elha yareahe hasi Yesu nau ekaso ekabuu he lugo lwa Minda ya Kiumbi, ekalholhoshi kuhinya vahe. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Vagiru va Vayahudi vekamaka mahinyo kuu vekakhwa veba, “Ya muhe emurue kimomo kuhinya to naho tenarahinywa?” <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yesu ekavaba, “Ya mburi nimuhinya si gho, mira nija Kiumbi enisughaye. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Muhe ekudumu kuboi mburi Kiumbi edumu, eneila ite mahinyo gho yeli he Kiumbi, hile ni mahinyo gho salaghe. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Hu vekuyoiya mburi kini wangau vedaa kukuyoiya kikulho salaghini, mira hu edaa ugiru wahu emsughae niu mkulho, naho tevata vahe vahali. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Ho, Musa temuoe miku? Mira tehelo neri muwe edara ka miku. Kwahoni mudumu munigaa?” <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Hu ifyo la vahe vekamba “Ulo ipepo ari! Niji edumu kukugaa?” <verse eid="JHN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu ekavaba, “Niboie kimako kiwe bi vakhabuna mukamaka.” <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Musa eemukeie mburi ja kutakhoiwa elha, ka mburi tejilie he Musa, mira jilie he vakaka kaghu, iji kune mumtakhoiya elha muinyi wa kiagiru he Muaze wa kusaaboi nyamalo. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Kai, muinyi wa kiagiru enetakhoiwa elha he Muaze wa kusaaboi nyamalo kalo miku yakwe Musa iseoniwe, kwakhoni munisanuiya ani kuuti muhe he Muaze wa kusaaboi nyamalo? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Roni kupaaya zamaro kwa mburi jo muaho, mira paani zamaro kwa kuliaha ukweri.<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu niu Masia elhoijwe ni Kiumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Niho vahe vakuwe va are Yerusalemu veekulhasuana, “Ho, yaye sihu muhe vekumdaa vamgaa? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Wesiani iji eyo na vahe vakhabuna esikumatue neri vagiru tevemlhiija kigi. Ho, tuba vagiru vaaila ite ya niu Masia? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Masia ekulita, tehelo eneile ite elie le, na nne tureile hodi ya muhe eli.” <verse eid="JHN 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Yesu areakhwa ehinya he Minda ya Kiumbi, ekayoisha ekuba, “Ho, mureniila naho mureila hodi nilie? Neri silitie kwa umuruisho gho salaghe. Mira hu enisughaye niwa kweri na kune temumuilie, <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />ani nimuilie kwaite nilie hakuu, nau niu enisughaye.” <verse eid="JHN 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Vekadaa kwalhi ya kumdara, mira tehelo egalie kumdara kwaite madamo kuu teyeenahe. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Mira ifyo la vahe vakumure vekamdarisha, veekuba “Ho, Masia ekunelita eneboi vimako vigiru kutakho ya muhe?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vakilaaru vetasughawe varemdara Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Mafarisayo vekako vahe vekupoghosha mburi jakwe Yesu, kwato vo na vagiru va muaresi vekasugha vakilaaru va minda ya Kiumbi varemdara Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yesu ekaba, “Nirecheri aha hawe na kune kwa madamo maghere, naho nnekirii hehu enisughaye. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Munenidaa mira temukaniakho, kwaite temumuru kuso hodi nineso.” <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Vagiru va Vayahudi vekalhasuana, “Ho, ya muhe edumu asole hodi tusikamuru kumuakho? Hile eneso he madi ya uda, hodi vedie Vayahudi vahe vakue vesi Vayahudi na kuvahinya vahe vesi Vayahudi? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Kwaakhoni eyo to, ekuba, Munenidaa mira temukaniaho, naho tetukamuru kuhe hodi eaha.?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miharaza ya mai ya uzime</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Hu muaze wa mkhito wa elha, muaze hu mgiru. Yesu ekauma, ekayoisha, “Muhe elo kasu alita hagho awaha mai, <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />neri muwe ekunidarisha edumuwa awaha. Sakigi Magondo ya Kiumbi eba, Miharaza ya mai ya uzime inesuika kuli he swaho yaka venenidarisha.” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Yesu eekuyoiya mburi ya Swaho Mnyakhare nahu vakhabuna vemdarishe vesemdoria. Madamo ka Swaho Mnyakhare teenaba kuguwe kwaite Yesu teenaba kudoria ugiru kuli he Aba Kiumbi.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vahe vetakakaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Vahe vakuwe vareko ekuyo to vekaba, “Kweri ya muhe ni Mroto wa Kiumbi!” <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Vahali vekaba, “Ya niu Kiristo.” Mira vahali vekalhasu, “Ho nikweri Masia eneli he idi la Galilaya? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Ho Magondo ya Kiumbi teeba, Kiristo eneli he ikolwa lakwe Dilao Daudi, naho eneakhoika are Betilehemu, he muang'a wakwe Daudi.” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Kwato vahe vekakakaana kwahu mburi jakwe Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Vahe vakuwe veedumue kumdara mira tehelo egalie kumdara.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vagiru va Vayahudi vetalhi kumdarisha Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Hu vakilaaru va Minda ya Kiumbi vareakirii vesilo ne Yesu, vagiru va muaresi na Mafarisayo vekavalhasu “Kwaakhoni temumdarae na kumgera?” <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Hu vakilaaru va Minda ya Kiumbi vekavaba, “Neri tehelo muhe emurue kuyo viome vilo viugho saya muhe.” <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Mafarisayo vekavalhasu, “Ho, na kune mwataika? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Ho, temuakho ite tehelo madilao hile Mafarisayo vemdarishe ya muhe? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Vahe vemdarisha ya muhe nihu vesiilie miku yakwe Musa Kiumbi evabusu lupae vahe saya.” <verse eid="JHN 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Muwe wa Mafarisayo eaha too nee Nikodemo, hu eesoe he Yesu naama, ekavalhasu, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Ho, miku kanu iba ite tumpaaie muhe zamaro tusina mlhahonha na kuile cho eboie?” <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Vekamba “Ni kikulho,” Ni kweri na ari ulie Galilaya. Wesiisha magondo ya Kiumbi uneakho ite tehelo mroto wa Kiumbi eyowe ite elie Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Niho vekaka, kira muwe ekagale.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Mlage eheiwe ebodie na muagiru wa muhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Mira Yesu ekaso he lubwa lwa mizeituni. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Lhenu kuu ama ama Yesu ekaso kahali he minda ya Kiumbi, vahe vakumure vekabunguru ho eaha, nau ekazokhodi ekalholhoshi kuvahinya. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Vahinya va miku yakwe Musa na Mafarisayo vekamgera mlage muwe eheiwe ebodie na muagiru esimkuu, Vekamuumati hasi he ifyo la vahe vakhabuna. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Vekamba Yesu, “Mhinya, ya mlage eheiwe ebodie na muagiru esimkuu. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />He miku, Musa eetubae ite mlage eboi kigi saya amawe masaheru sari aga. Ho, ari ubamo?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Vemlhasue to kwa kumgali, kalo vaakho kigi cha kumyoija. Mira Yesu ekaduduku, ekalholhoshi kugonda di he mpulhe na kisatu kuu. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Varecheri kumlhasu, Yesu ekauma ekavaba, “Kai helo muhe he kune esilo makusa akhwa wa bosi kumma ka mlage isaheru.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Ekaduduku kahali ekagonda he mpulhe. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Vareako to, vekalholhoshi kuli muwe muwe, vekukaeiwa ni vaagiru vazime. Yesu ekamerisi salaghe, na hu mlage echeri umae kuwesiana ne Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yesu ekauma ekamlhasu ka mlage, “Hu vahe veaha le vekukuyoija ite ari ulo makusa? Ho, tehelo ekuzamarie?” <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Ka mlage ekamba, “Dilao, tehelo neri muwe!” Yesu nau ekamba ni kikulho, “Na ani sikakuzamari. So, naho kuli waijiji usiboi makusa kahali.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu niu luatame lwa vahe va idi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yesu ekayo kahali naka vahe ekavaba, “Ani niu luatame lwa vahe va idi” “Enidarisha ani na kuniko tekazokho neri he kidughu, mira enekhwa na luatame lwa uzime wa maaze khabuna” <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Niho Mafarisayo vekamba, “Ari ukuyoiya neri muhe muhali kuko na kuakho chouyo kwato choukuyoiya sicha kweri.” <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu ekavaba, “Neri ite nikuyoia cho niilie ani salaghe, mira viome gho nivya kweri kwaite ani nireila hodi nilie na hodi niso. Mira kune temuilie nilie le neri niso le. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Kune muzamari kwa kuliaha viugho vya vahe, mira ani sizamari muhe. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Mira neri kai nikuzamari to, zamaro gho niya kweri, kwaite sigu zamaro salaghe, mira ani ne Aba enisughae tuzamari hawe. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Igondiwe he miku kanu ite, kigi chiahowe ni vahe vanu ni kweri. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Vanu veakhoe niani Aba enisughaye kwato ya tuyo niya kweri.” <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Niho vekamlhasu, “Aba kechi eaha le?” Yesu ekavaba, “Kune temunilie ani, neri Aba gho. Kai mweniilie ani, Aba gho nau mwesemuilie.” <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesu eeyoe ka viome madamo ekuhinya he su hodi mihaku na mari vyeekuzokho he minda ya Kiumbi. Mira tehelo emdarie, kwaite madamo kuu teenahe.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Temumuru kuso hodi niso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesu ekavaba kahali, “Ani nineso, munenidaa, mira munega he makusa kaghu. Temukamuru kuso hodi niso.” <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Niho vagiru va Vayahudi vekaba, “Eba ite tetukamuru kuso hodi eso. Hile etarakugaa?” <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yesu ekavaba, “Kune mulie waii he idi, mira ani nilie ana. Kune muvahe vaya idi, mira ani si waya idi. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Niu chiro nimubae ite munega he makusa kaghu. Kai mukusedarisha ite Ani niu, munega he makusa kaghu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Navo vekamlhasu, “Ari uji?” Yesu ekavaba, “Ani niu sakigi neemubaie kuli azeto. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Nilo makumure akuyo na akumuzamari, mira hu enisughae niwa kweri, na ani nitavabaia vahe va idi hu mburi nijikoie kuli heu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Teveilie ite Yesu eekuvabaia mburi ja Abaghe. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Niho ekavaba, “Mukumrengesha Muinyi wa Mhe, niho muneila ite Ani niu. Nahosiboi neri kigi salaghe, mira niboi sacho Aba enihinyie.” <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Hu enisughae eaha hawe na ani, teniroe salaghe, kwaite madamo makhabuna niboi hu mburi jimlhamuia. <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Yesu areakhwa eyo to vahe vakumure vekamdarisha.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukweri unemulhamera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Niho Yesu ekavaba hu Vayahudi vemdarishe, “Kai muneko hu mahinyo gho nimuhinyie munekhwa vahina gho kweri. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Muneila kweri, naka kweri inemuboi mulhamerwe kuli he uhaye.” <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Navo vekamba, “Nne tuikolwa lakwe Aburahamu.” “Kahali tetuila kukhwa vahaye va muhe neri muwe. Kwakhoni uba, Tunelhamerwa?” <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu ekavaba, “Kweri nitamubaia, kira muhe eboi makusa ni mhaye wa makusa. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Mhaye tezokho ang'a miaze khabuna, mira Muinyi enezokho ang'a kini maaze khabuna. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Mira Muinyi ekumlhamera munekhwa na mlhamero wa kweri. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Nireila ite kune muikolo lakwe Aburahamu. Mira mudumu munigaa, kwaite temuyadoria mahinyo gho. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Ani niyo hu niakhoe neeaha ne Aba gho, mira kune muboi hu aba kaghu emubae muboi.” <verse eid="JHN 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Vekamba “Nne tu vainyi vakwe Aburahamu!” Yesu ekavaba “Kai kune mwee va ikolwa lakwe Aburahamu kweri, mweseboie hu yeekuboiwa ni Aburahamu. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Ani nimubaie ukweri niukoie he Kiumbi, mira kune mudumu munigaa. Aburahamu teeboie to. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Kune muboi mburi wahuhu aba kaghu ejiboi” Vekamba, Na nne tetuvainyi va gahana “Tulo aba muwe bi niu Kiumbi.” <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu ekavaba, “Kai Kiumbi nee Aba kaghu kweri, mwesenidumue ani, kwaite ani nilie he Kiumbi na waijiji niaha ii. Siani nikusughae salaghe, mira Kiumbi niu enisughae. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Kwakhoni temukoia kigi niyo, ni kwaite temmuru kuyako huyo nimubaia. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Kune muvainyi va aba kaghu Shetani mudumu bi kuboi hucho edumu aba kaghu. Kuli azeto ekugaa, neri teumaia kweri, kwaite kweri teiaha nau. Ekuyo lame, eyo sakigi msa kuu utoe, kwaite u nimlame kahali ni aba wa lame. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Mira ani nimubaia ukweri kune temunidarisha. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Niji enemuru kuaija ite nilo makusa? Kai nimubaia kweri kwakhoni temunidarisha? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Hu eliye he Kiumbi eralakhonha mburi ja Kiumbi. Mira kune temulakhonha kwaite temliye he Kiumbi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni mgiru kutakho Aburahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Vayahudi vekamba, “Ho, tetuyoe kweri ite ari Umsamaria, kahali ulo ipepo?” <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu ekavaba, “Ani silo ipepo, ani nimko Aba gho, mira kune temniko. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Ani sidaa lugimbiko gho salaghe, mira helo edumu kunio lugimbiko, nau ezamari neri kulhoija muhe. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Kweri nitamubaia, edara mahinyo gho tekaga neri.” <verse eid="JHN 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Niho Vayahudi vekamba, “Iji, twaile kweri ite ulo ipepo. Aburahamu aaga, varoto nau vaaga, mira ari utaba ite, muhe edara viome gho tekaga neri. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Ho ari ukuboi umgiru kutakho Aba kanu Aburahamu egae? Varoto nau vaaga. Kwato ari uji?” <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu ekavaba, “Nikukugimbika salaghe lugimbiko gho lunekhwa sikigi. Aba gho hu muba ni Aba kaghu niu enigimbika. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Kune temumuilie, mira ani nimuila. Kai neeteba simuilie neseekhwae mlame sakune cho mukhwae valame. Mira ani niremuile kahali nirako kiome kuu. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Aba kaghu Aburahamu eelhamuiwe ekuarira kuakho muaze gho wakulita, nau areuakho ekalhamuwa.” <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Vayahudi vekamba, “Ari tunaba kuheti miko mikado mikoi, mira umuru kimomo kuba wamuakho Aburahamu?” <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu ekavaba, “ Nitamubaia ukweri, Aburahamu esinaakhoika ani neereaha.” <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Niho vekadodoli masaheru kalo vamma, mira Yesu ekakumatu naho ekali he minda ya Kiumbi.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etamuuti muhe eakhoke eegae maila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yesu areakhwa etaho, ekamuakho muhe egae maila kuli kuahoika kuu. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Vahina kuu vekamlhasu, “Mhinya niji eboie makusa, niho ekaahoka teaho, niya muhe hile nihu vemsae?” <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu ekavaba, “Ya muhe teboie makusa neri hu vemsae teveboie makusa, mira eahoke to kalo nyamalo ya Kiumbi iahoike he mizokhore kuu. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Ikukhwa hecheri chakako tudumuwa tuboi nyamalo ja hu enisughaye, kwaite kiama chilitie tehelo enemuru kuboi nyamalo. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Ikukhwa nicheri aha heya idi, ani ni luatame lwa vahe va idi.” <verse eid="JHN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Arefi kuyo to, ekabusu mapae di he mpulhe, ekaboi kisalo kwa mapae, ekamlhomi hu muhe esiaho he maila. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Ekumba “So ureonhi vubasa he idibo lamai lisewa siloamu.” nikuba “Esughawe.” Niho hu muhe ekaso, ekaonhi, ekakirii eakho. <verse eid="JHN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Vahe kuu vasina na vahe vahali veemuakhoe ekulhawa lhawa, vekalhasuana, “Ho ya sihu muhe eekuzokodi ii na eekulhawa lhawa?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Vahe vakuwe vekaba, “Niu.” vahali vekaba, “Siu mira etatotiana nau.” Mira ka muhe ekaba, “Niani.” <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Kwato vekuramlhasu, “Iji, maila kechi eelhaike kimomo niho ukamuru kuakho?” <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Nau ekavaba, “Hu muhe esewa Yesu eeboie kisalo, ekanilhomi he maila gho ekaniba, niso nireonhi vubasa he idibo la Siloamu. Naani nikaso, nikaonhi nikamuru kuakho.” <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Vekamlhassu, “Ka muhe u eaha le?” Ekavaba, “Siilie ani.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafarisayo vetawesiisha cho elo maila esiakho eutiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Vekamtii hu muhe elhaiwe maila he Mafarisayo. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Ka muaze Yesu areboi kisalo ekamlhomi ka muhe he maila, naho maila kuu ekalhaika nee Muaze wa kusaaboi nyamalo. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Mafarisayo vekamlhasu kahali ka muhe, “Umurue kimomo kuakho?” Ekavaba, “Etenilhomi kisalo he maila gho, nikaonhi vubasa naho waijiji niakho.” <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Mafarisayo vakuwe vekaba, “Muhe emuru kuboi to teli he Kiumbi, kwaite tedara miku ya Muaze wa kusaaboi nyamalo.” Mira vahali vekaba, “Muhe elo makusa emuru kimomo kuboi vimako vitoe to?” Mafarisayo vekatakhoana viome. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Vekamlhasu kahali ka muhe elhaiwe maila, “Kwaite akulha maila, umyoia kimomo ka muhe ekulhae maila?” Nau ekavaba, “Ka muhe ni mroto wa Kiumbi” <verse eid="JHN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Vagiru va Vayahudi tevedarishe ite ka muhe eegae maila, naho waijiji eakho, kwato vekamse abaghe ne alhii kuu. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Vekavalhasu abaghe ne alhii kuu, “Ho, ya ni muinyi kaghu, muba ite eakhoke eegae maila? Iji emurue kimomo kuakho?” <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Abaghe ne alhii kuu vekaba, “Tureila ite ya ni muinyi kanu naho eeakhoike egae maila. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Mira tetuilie emurue kimomo kuakho, neri kuila niji emlhae maila. Mlhasuni kwaite ni muhe mzime, enemubaiya.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Abaghe ne lage kini veeyoe to kwaite veekuvabughenu vagiru va Vayahudi, kwaite ka vagiru veisekoe ite muhe eneba ite Yesu ni Masia enegugulutiwe hodi vesahea Vayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Niu chiro abaghe ne lage kini vekaba, “Mlhasuni u ni muhe mzime.” <verse eid="JHN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Vekamse kakanu ka muhe elhaiwe maila, vekamba, “Muo Kiumbi ugiru! Nne tureila ite ya muhe ekuutie elo makusa.” <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Ekavaba “Kai elo makusa ani siilie, kigi niilie ani ni kiwe bi, seekumuru kuakho mira waijiji niraakho.” <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Vekamlhasu, “Ekuboie kiahoni? Ekulhae kimomo maila kechi?” <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Ka muhe ekavaba, “Naafi kumubaia, mira kune temudumu kunilahonha, kwahoni mudumu kukoia kahali? Tuba mudumu mukhwa vahina kuu?” <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Mira vekamuolhu vekamba, “Ari umhina kuu mira nne tuvahina vakwe Musa. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Kigi tuilie ni ite Kiumbi eeyoe ne Musa. Mira tetuilie ya muhe elie nale” <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Hu muhe ekavaba, “Ya ni mburi ya kububulusha! Kune temuilie elie nale, mira aanilha maila gho! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Tureila ite Kiumbi tevalakhonha vahe velo makusa, mira evalahonha vakhabuna vemlakhonha na kuboi mburi kuu edumu. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Kuli idi liboiwe teirakoika muhe emlhae maila muhe eakhoike na maila esiakho. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Kai ya muhe telie he Kiumbi, teseemuru kuboi neri kigi.” <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Vekamba, “Ari uahoike na kulherutiwe he makusa, umuru kimomo kugali kutuhinya nne?” Niho vekamguguluti ali gahana.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Swaho igae maila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesu ekakoia ite vamguguluti ali gahana. Aremheia ekamlhasu “Uramdarisha Muinyi wa Muhe?” <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Ka muhe ekaba, “Mgiru, nibaiya, ka niji, kalo nimdarishe.” <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu ekamba, “Waafiriti kumuakho niu ya eyo na ari waijiji.” <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Ka muhe ekaba, “Dilao! niradarisha, ekama mamuro ekadudukhu na ekamuaresi.” <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesu ekaba , “Ani nilitie he idi kugu zamaro, kalo vesiakho vaakho, nahu veakho vaga maila.” <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Mafarisayo vakuwe veeaha sina nau vekakoia cho eekuyo, vekamba, “Ho, na nne tugae maila?” <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu ekavaba, “Kai mweegae maila, nangai temulo makusa, mira kune muba ite turaakho, kwato chiaija ite temukaiwe makusa kaghu ni kiumbi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Mzemo mkulho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesu ekavaba, “Nitamubaia kweri, muhe neri muwe esitakhoia he luhige kubuu he minda ya maalu mira ekukutu ana na kubuu, ka ni mgwalo na mzaale. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Mira ebuu kwa kutahoia he luhige, ka ni mzemo wa maalu. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Mkilaaru etamlhaia mzemo luhige, maalu nau enekoia kiome cha mzemo, nau etaase kira ialu kwa ilhe kuu, ekuakaeti kuso gahana. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Mzemo ekuraagu gahana maalu kuu makhabuna, etaakaeia, naka maalu etamliaha, kwaite ereila kiome kuu. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Ka maalu teemuru kumliaha muhe mgalho, mira enemgugulu kwaite teeilie viome vya vagalho.” <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu eevabaie ka mtotire, mira teveilie ite eekuyoia kiakhoni.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mzemo mkulho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Kwato ekavabaia kahali, “Nimubaia kweri ani niu luhige lwa maalu. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Hu vakhabu venikaeie ni vagwalo na vazaale, naka maalu teevalakhonhe. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Ani ni luhige, ebuu kutakhoia ani enekombowe, enekhwa enebuu na kuli, kahali eneakho vighu enevidumu. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Mgwalo elita kalo agwa na agaa na kuoni. Ani nilitie kalo mukhwa na uzime kahali mukhwa nau mkumure. <verse eid="JHN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Ani ni mzemo mkulho, mzemo mkulho emuru kulakhati uzime kuu kalo maalu kuu asigaawe. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Mnyamalo, esi mzemo, neri maalu si makuu, ekuakho madie amaeza elitie, etaaro maalu etagugulu, niho madie amaeza etaadara ka maalu na kuaparati. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />U tehiri swaho kuu kwa mburi yaka maalu kwaite u ni muhe ewesia mihaku elhanuwa bi. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Ani ni mzemo mkulho wa vahe gho. Nirevaila vahe gho, navo vereniila kikulho, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />Sahu kigi Aba eniilie ani nicho ni muilie Aba, ani nigu uzime gho kalo nivakombo vahe gho. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Kahali nilo maalu mahali esiaha heya minda. Naka nidumua niagere, enekoia kiome gho, naho henekhwa na ifyo iwe na mzemo muwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Aba enidumue kwaite niugu uzime gho kalo niudori kahali. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Tehelo muhe eniale uzime gho, ani niugu kigi ninedumu salaghe. Nilo umuruisho wa kuugu na kuudori kahali. Ya niu kigi Aba enibae niboi.” <verse eid="JHN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Kutakhoia ka viome Vayahudi vekatakhoana viome. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Vakumure veekuraba, “Elo ipepo, vahali vekaba ni mkilalu! Kwakhoni mumlakhonha”? <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Vahali veekuba, “Ya si viome viyowa ni muhe elo ipepo. Ho, ipepo limuru kulha maila ya muhe esiakho?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vayahudi vetamlhi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Are he idi la Yerusalemu heelo elha ya kuhulha kuike minda ya Kiumbi ikhwa kikulho heu, nee madamo ya kihuho. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yesu nau ekakhwa edaha za he lukumbi lwa minda ya kuaresia wakwe Solomoni. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Vayahudi vekamhuia vekamlhasu, “Unetuke he mitotire sari ami? Kai ari niu Masia, tubaie neri kumatu.” <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu ekavaba, “Namubaia mira temudarisha. Nyamalo nijiboi kwa ugiru wa Aba gho jiraaija ite ani niji. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Mira kune temudarisha kwaite temu maalu gho. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Maalu gho erakoia kiome gho, ani nireaila, nau eraniliaha. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Ani nimuo uzime wa maaze makhabuna, navo tevekaga neri, tehelo muhe enemuru kuniale kuli he miharegha gho. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Aba gho enioe ka maalu na niu mgiru kutakho vakhabuna, neri tehelo emuru kuyaale kuli miharegha ya Aba gho. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Ani ne Aba ni kigi kiwe.” <verse eid="JHN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Vayahudi vekadodoli masaheru kahali kalo vamma, <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />mira Yesu ekavaba kahali, “Namuaija nyamalo kumure kuli he Aba. Ninyamalo mina heka imuboi munima masaheru?” <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Vayahudi vekamba, “Tetukuma masaheru kwaite waaboi nyamalo kulho, mira kwa mburi ya kum'olhu Kiumbi! Kwaite u muhe biu mira kuboi ari u Kiumbi.” <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu ekavaba, “He miku kaghu hegondiwe ite Kiumbi ebae, kune muviumbi?” <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Kai hu vesewe kiome cheelitie hevo cheevasee viumbi. Tureila ite magondo ya Kiumbi eyo kweri madamo khabuna. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Ho mumuru kimomo kuba ite hu elhoijwe ni Aba na kusughawa he idi etam'olhu Kiumbi kwaite eba ite Ani ni Muinyi wa Kiumbi? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Kai siboi nyamalo ja Aba gho musinidarishe. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Mira ikukhwa, nirajiboi, hata kai temunidarisha, jidarisheni bi ka nyamalo, kalo muile ite Aba eaha za hagho na ani niaha za hakuu. <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Vekagali kahali kumdara Yesu, mira ekali he miharegha kini. <verse eid="JHN 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Niho Yesu ekaso kahali, bwa wa kanu wa mharaza usewa Yoridani, hodi Yohana ekubatija ata azeto, ekazokho are. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Vahe vakumure vekaso he Yesu navo veekuba, “Yohana teboie kimako neri kiwe mira viome khabuna vyoeyoe ni vya ya muhe nija kweri.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Vahe vakumure veaha to vekamdarishe Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Kigame chakwe Lazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Heelo muhe eekusewa Lazaro, nau nee mrukhao, ka muhe eekudi muang'a wa Betania vaing'inha kuu nee Maria ne Mata, . <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Ya Maria nihu mlage eemsuie Dilao malhoma esumu kikulho he masame naho ekamsiki na alhu kuu kwato inka kini Lazaro nee mrukhao. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Kwato Maria ne Mata vekamsugha muo he Yesu, vekamba, “Dilao, msaho kechi umdumushe ni mrukhao.” <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Mira Yesu areko to ekaba, “Ya urukhao teukamgaa, mira uneaija ugiru wa Kiumbi kalo Muinyi wa Kiumbi aowe ugiru kutakhoia ka urukhao.” <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Neri ite Yesu eekuvadumu Mata, Maria ne Lazaro, <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Yesu erekoia ite Lazaro ni mrukhao, tehalie mira ekasusu miaze minu yakuzokho ho eaha. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Niho ekavaba vahina “Tusoni kahali Yudea!” <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Vahina vekamba, “Mhinya,” “Madamo maghere bi etakhoe Vayahudi vedumue kukuma masahu vakugaa, mira ari udumu kuso kahali are?” <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu ekaba “Ho, madamo a chakako si kela ikado nanu? Kwato, muhe ekudaha hachakako temuru kukuma kisatu kwaite eraaho kutakhoia luatame lwa idi. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Mira muhe ekudaha naama enekuma kisatu, kwaite za kini tehelo luatame.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Yesu erefi kuyo to ekavaba “Msaho kanu Lazaro etei mira ani nneso kuramkaa.” <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Vahina kuu vekamba, “Dilao, kai etei eneu.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Vo veelie ite Yesu eekuyoya mburi ya kui luireno, kave ekuyoya mburi ya kigame chakwe Lazaro. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Niho Yesu ekavabaia neri kuvamatu ite “Lazaro aaga, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />mira nilhamuiwa kwa mburi kaghu ite Lazaro areaga ani seaha are, kalo mumuru kudarishe. Mira iji tusoni he muang'a kuu.” <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Tomasi hu ekusewa Pacha ekavaba vahina vaaro, “Tusoni na nne turega hawe nau!”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu niu uzime uvakaa vegae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yesu areahe are ekaheia Lazaro eaha za he mbira maaze mahai. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Muang'a Betania weaha sina na muang'a wa Yerusalemu, weekuhe uda wa kiromita khai kuhe , <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Vayahudi vakumure veehee he muang'a wakwe Mata ne Maria kuravapu muharegha kwa kugaiwa ni inka kini Lazaro. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Mata arekoia ite Yesu elitie ekaso kuramdoria, mira Maria u ekafufu ang'a. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Mata ekamba Yesu, “Dilao, kai wereaha ii, inka gho teseegae” <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Mira nireila ite neri waijiji kira cho unemlhawa Kiumbi, enekuo. <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu ekamba, “Inka kechi eneka kuli he kigame.” <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Mata ekamba, “Nireila ite eneka kuli he kigame madamo yakuukaiwa vahe muaze wa mkhito.” <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu ekamba, “Ani niu ka uzime na kukaa kuli he kigame. Enidarisha ani neri kai enega, enefufu, <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />nahu efufu ekunidarisha tekaga neri. Ho, uradarisha ya viome?” <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Mata ekamba, “Dilao, ani niradarisha! Ite ari niu Masia, Muinyi wa Kiumbi, hu Kiumbi eekee muo ite enemsugha.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etamzoia Lazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Mata areafi kuyo to, ekaso kumse wau kuu Maria kakera ekamba “Mhinya ereaha ii ekuse.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Maria areakoia to ekamangaso sari hodi Yesu ereaha. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Yesu teenaba kubuu he kijiji cha Betania, mira eereaha wato oto hodi Mata emheie. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Hu Vayahudi velitie kumtaari Maria, veremuakho ekumangali gahana, vekamliaha. Vebae eekuso he mbira kurazo. <verse eid="JHN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Maria arehe hodi Yesu eaha ekama mamuro, ekamba, “Dilao, kai wereaha ii, kaka gho tesegae!” <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yesu areamuakho Maria ekuzo, nahu Vayahudi velitie hawe ne Maria vekuzo, ekadariwa ni vuhuye ekahiri he swaho. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Yesu ekavalhasu, “Mumkeie le?” Vekamba, “Dilao, lita uakho ho tumkee.” <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu ekazo. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Vayahudi vekaba, “Wesiani kigi cho eemdumushe Lazaro!” <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Mira vakuwe vekaba, “Ho, ya siu emlhae maila muhe esiakho, kwaakhoni temurue kumtiti Lazaro asiga?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etamkaa Lazaro kuli he kigame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Yesu ekahiri kahali swaho, ekahe he mbira. Ka mbira ne mhanga, yelhatiwe na isahu to hakubuia. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu ekaba, “Kaani ka isaheru!” Mata ing'inhii kini waka egae, ekamba, “Dilao, alholhoshi kusumu, yaataho miaze mihai kuli akewe he mbira!” <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesu ekamba, “Ho, seekubae ite ukudarisha uneaho ugiru wa Kiumbi?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Vekalikaa hu isahu. Yesu ekawesia ana he malhareno ekaba, “Nikugimbika Aba kwaite uranikoia. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Niilie ite uranilakhonha madamo makhabuna mira niyoe to kwa mburi yaya vahe veumae ii kalo vadarishe ite ari niu unisughae.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Arefi kuyo to, ekayoisha ekaba, “Lazaro lita ilai gahana!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Lazaro eegae ekali gahana, ilai eorowe sanda he masaamu, miharegha,na vubasa kuu ighubikwe. Yesu ekavaba, “Mgeni, mumro aso.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vayahudi vedumu kumgaa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mariko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Vayahudi vakumure veeaha hawe ne Maria vareakho mburi jo Yesu ejiboie, vekamdarisha. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Mira vakuwe vekaso he Mafarisayo vekavabaia hu mburi Yesu eiboie. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Kwato Madilio va muaresi na Mafarisayo vekasahe he ibaraza igiru la Vayahudi vekalhasuana, “Tusa kimomo? Ya muhe eboi lhaa kumure. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Kai tukumuro bi aboi to vahe vakabuna venemdarisha, naka udilao wa Varoma unelita kuraioni minda ya Kiumbi na idi kanu.” <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Mira muaro kini muwe ekusewa Kayafa, nee mgiru wa muaresi heka mko, ekavaba, “Kune temuilie kigi neri! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Temuakho ite ni kikulho muhe muwe aga kwa mburi ya vahe, kuro idi izime liga?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />U te yoe to kwa kudumu salaghe, mira kwaite bi nee mgiru wa kuaresi heka mko, egue uroto ite Yesu enega kwa mburi ya idi kini . <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Mira sikwamburi yaka idi bi, mira nihawe na vainyi va Kiumbi veparatiwe kira hodi, kalo evagere hodi hawe nakuvaboi vakhwa kigi kiwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Kwato kuli ka muaze vagiru va Vayahudi veekuradaa kwalhi yakumgaa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Kwato Yesu ekaro kudaha hodi Vayahudi vesahea, mira ekahali ata, ekaso hodi sina na he ilangwa liaha he muang'a usewa Efuraimu, Ekazokhodi are hawe na vahina kuu. <verse eid="JHN 11:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Madamo elha ya Vayahudi isewa Pasaka ireahe sina, vahe vakumure vekaso Yerusalemu kalo vakuke kikulho he miku ya kumuaresi Kiumbi, ka elha isinaba kuhe. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Ka vahe veesoe Yerusalemu vekakhwa vemdaa Yesu. Varesahe hawe za he lugo lwa minda ya Kiumbi, vekalhasuana,“Muakho kimomo? Chimuruikana tekalite neri he elha.” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Vagiru va muaresi na Mafarisayo veevaajie vahe ite muhe eilie hodi Yesu eaha, edumuwa evabaie kalo vamuru kumdara.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Maria etamlhomi Yesu malhoma amihaku mikumure</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mariko 14:3-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Miaze tizu elha ya Pasaka isinaba kuhe, Yesu ekahe Betania, ang'a hakwe Lazaro, hu emkaie kuli he kigame. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Are Vemkeiye viaghu vya chamagheri, Mata niu eekuvageria viaghu, madamo ka Lazaro eeaha hawe ne Yesu to he meza. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Maria ekadori nyhupa ya nusu lita ilo malhoma ekusumu kikulho ya mihaku mikumure eboiwa kuli he mkhatu usewa nado, ekamsuia Yesu ka malhoma he masame kahali ekamsiki ka malhoma na alhu kuu. Minda khabuna yeekusumu kikulho kwa mburi yaka malhoma. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Niho Yuda Isikarioti, muwe wahu ikado na vanu enemlhi Yesu ekalhasu ekaba, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Kwaakhoni ya malhoma ekusedidiwa kwa vikhao magana makai viagha na madini ya esewe feza , naka mhaku vekaowe vahuye?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Yuda eeyoe to, siite eekuvatotia vahuye, mira nee mgwalo, nee u eekuzokho ibegila mihaku, naho kira madamo eekugwa ka mihaku. <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Mira Yesu ekaba “Mroni ya mlage! teadidie ka malhoma kwa mburi ya muaze gho wa kukewe he mbira. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Vahuye muaha navo maaze khabuna, mira ani temkazoko na ani maaze khabuna.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vayahudi vedumu kumgaa Lazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Vayahudi vakumure vekakoia ite Yesu eaha Betania, Kwato vekaso are tevesoe kuramuaho Yesu bi mira nihawe na kumuakho Lazaro hu ekaaiwe ni Yesu kuli he kigame. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Kwaite Masadukayo teveekudarisha mburi ya kuka kuli he kigame, kwato vekadaa kwali ya kumgaa Lazaro, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />kwaite kwa mburi yakwe Lazaro Vayahudi vakumure veemdarishe Yesu mira vekavakherii vagiru kini.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etabuu Yerusalemu se Dilao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Muaze wa kanu, ifyo igiru la vahe leelitiye he elha ya Pasaka veekoie ite Yesu elitie Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Kwato vekapu matambi ya mitende naho vekaramhungira kwa kumko, vekakaa viome vekuba, “Hosana, tumfaruie DILAO, tumfaruie hu etuboia makulho ka elita hakanu kwa ilhe la Kiumbi, aboiwe makulho ka elitie kukhwa Dilao wa Iziraeli.” <verse eid="JHN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yesu ekaakho muinyi wa mhunda, ekamkutu sakigi magondo eba, <verse eid="JHN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Kune vahe va Yerusalemu msibughenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">Wesia, Dilao kaghu elitie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">ekutue he muinyi wa mhunda kwa nhunguru.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Madamo ka vahina vakwe Yesu teveilie ka mburi, mira Yesu areaka kuli he kigame ekaowa ugiru, niho vekahulha ite ka makhabuna yeegondiwe kumyoia u salaghe, navo veemboiie sacho cheegondiwe. <verse eid="JHN 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Vahe veaha hawe ne Yesu madamo Lazaro ekuli he mbira, vekuravabaiya vahali huyo veakhoe. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Ya niu chiboie ka vahe veekoie ite Yesu niu eboie ka kimako vekaso kuramdoria . <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Kwato Mafarisayo vekabaiana , “Muraaho? Tetumuru kuboi neri kigi! Wesiani, vahe vakhabuna vetamliaha.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vagiriki vakuwe vedumu kumuakho Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Heelo Vagiriki vakuwe hehu vahe vehee kuaresi madamo ya elha ya Pasaka. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Ka Vagiriki vekamliaha Filipo, eedie he muang'a usewa Betisaida are he idi la Galilaya, vekamba, “Dilao, tudumu tumuakho Yesu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filipo ekaso ekambaia Andrea, niho ka vanu vekaso kurambaia Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu ekavaba, “Madamo a Muinyi wa Muhe kudaria ugiru yaahe! <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Kweri nitamubaia, mhuluzi ya ngano irakhwa mhuluzi we bi ikusaalhu he mpulhe ikaga. Mira ikutuiwa he mpulhe na kubo itasa mpuluzi kumure. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Hu veudumu uzime kini, veneulahati, mira veusanuiwa uzime kini heya idi, veneuke uzime kini usikhita. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Edumu kukhwa mnyamalo gho edumuwe aniliahe, kwaite kira hodi nineso mnyalo gho nau eneso . Muhe enekhwa mnyamalo gho Aba enemko.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etayoia kigame kuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“Swaho gho yaahiri, iji nibamo? Iji, niba, Aba, unikaa heya madamo ya kharo? Mira niu chiro naalita kalo nitakho heya madamo ya kharo. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Aba, uuaije ugiru kechi. Kiome chikakoika kuli ana he Kiumbi chikuba, naauaija, naho nineuaija kahali.” <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Ifyo la vahe vakumure veeumae to veechikoie ka kiome, vakuwe vekaba, “Ni lubambala.” “Mira vahali veebae, Mnyamalo wa Kiumbi aayo nau!” <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Mira Yesu ekavaba, “Ka kiome techilijanye kwa mburi ya gho mira chilijanye kwa mburi kune. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Kwato ya niu madamo vaya idi kuzamariwa, Shetani mgiru waya idi eaha sina kulakha umuruisho kuu. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Na ani nikurarengeshwa ana he msalaba ninemkhuru vahe vakhabuna valite hagho.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Yesu eekuvabaia kigi vahe venemgaa. <verse eid="JHN 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Kwato ka vahe vekamba, “Miku kanu ituba ite Masia enezokho madamo khabuna. Umuru kimomo kuba ite Muinyi wa Muhe enegaiwa he msalaba ana? Ka Muinyi wa Muhe niji?” <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yesu ekavaba, “Luatame lucheri khwa hawe na kune kwa madamo maghere. Dahani mwerelo naka luatame, kalo kidughu chiseemumuru, kwaite muhe edaha he kidughu teila hodi eso. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Kwato, madamo mweelo ka luatame ludarisheni kalo mukhwa vainyi va luatame.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">Vahe vesidarisha</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Yesu erefi kuyo to ekaso uda ekakumatu vahe vasimuaho. <verse eid="JHN 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Yesu hawe na kuboi vimako ikumure vekaviaho, mira tevemdarishe. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Kwaite mroto Isaya wakwe Kiumbi eyoe kweri ekuba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">“ Dilao, niji eidarishe mburi kanu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">Naho umuruisho wa Dilao uakhoike heji?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Kwato tevemurue kudarisha, niu chiro Isaya mroto wa Kiumbi nau eebae,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Kiumbi ayagaa maila kini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">aboi kutoti kini kusiboi nyamalo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">kalo vasireakho kwa maila kini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Naho vasireila kwa akiri kini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Naho veseeyo makusa kini nakuyaro,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Kiumbi nau ekavauti.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Isaya mroto wa Kiumbi eyoe to azeto na azeto kwaite eeakhoe cho Dilao emgiru naho ekagonda mburi kuu. <verse eid="JHN 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Mira vagiru va Vayahudi vakumure veemdarishe Yesu, mira kwa mburi ya Mafarisayo tevemdarishe he maila ya vahe kwaite vekubughenu ite venegugulujwa hodi ha kusaheya Vayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Veekudumu kukoiwa ni vahe kuro kukoiwa ni Kiumbi.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Viome vyakwe Yesu vinevazamari vahe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Niho Yesu ekayoisha ekaba, “Muhe enidarisha ani, tenidarisha ani bi mira eramdarisha nahu enisughae. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Eniakho ani eramuaho nahu enisughae. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Ani nilitie he vahe va idi kalo nikhwa luatame lwa kweri, kalo vakhabuna venidarisha vasifufu he kidughu. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Ani simzamari muhe neri muwe ekoia mahinyo gho mira teako, ani sikamzamari kwaite ani silitie kulizamari idi, mira nilitie kulikaa he makusa. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Venilhi ani na kusaadara mahinyo gho helo enevazamari. Viome vyo niyoe nivyo vinekhwa niu yenevazamari he muaze wa mkhito. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Ani siyoe ya mburi kwa kudumu salaghe, mira Aba enisughae niu enibaie mburi ja kuyo naho nijiyo kimomo. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Ani nireila ite mburi enisughae nijiyo jenevaboi vahe vazokho maaze makhabuna. Kwato ani niyo hu mburi Aba enisughae niyo.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etavaonhi vahina kuu masame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Muaze wa elha ya Pasaka usinahe, Yesu eereila ite madamo kuu ya kuli he idi kuso hakwe Aba yehee. Nau eekuvadumu vahe khabuna veekumdarisha, kahali eevadumuishe. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Madamo ya chamagheri Yesu na vahina kuu veekuraa viaghu, Shetani eefie kumbutu Yuda muinyi wakwe Simoni Iskariote mitotire ya kumkherii Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu eekuila ite Aba emoe vigi vikhabuna, kahali eliye he Kiumbi naho etakhwaa kahali he Kiumbi. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Kwato ekali to vekuaia viaghu, ekagu gomae kuu ya ana ekaike khakhera, ekadori kitambala ekakuoro hasi hasi he msa. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Ekabutu mai he ibakuri, ekalholhoshi kuvaonhi vahina kuu masame ilai ekuvasiki nahu kitambala echioroe hasi hasi he msa. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Kwato ekahe hodi ezokhodie Simoni Petro, Petro nau ekaba, “Dilao, nimuru kimomo kukudumuija ari unionhi ani masame?” <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu ekamba, “Tuilie waijiji kigi mina niboi mira uneila kalufunda.” <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Petro ekamba, “Ari tukanionhi masame neri!” Yesu ekamba, “Nikusaakuonhi masame tukakhwa hawe na ani kahali.” <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Niho Simoni Petro ekamba, “Dilao, nionhi, mira usinionhi masame bi, unionhi miharegha na mua.” <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu ekamba “Muhe eonhie msa mzime chidumuwa aonhi masame bi kwaite msa uakhue. Kune muakhue mira temuakhue vakabuna.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yesu eeyoe to kwaite eemuilie hu enemkherii, niu chiro ekaba, “Kune muakhue, mira sivakhabuna.” <verse eid="JHN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Arefi kuvaonhi masame kini na kuoro kahali gomae kuu ya ana, ekakhwaa kahali to hakuaia viaghu nau gomae kuu ya ani ekavalhasu, “Ho, mwaila kigi ni cho muboie? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Kune munise Mhinya kahali Dilao, kwato muyo kweri kwaite niu kigi nitoe. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Kwato, ikukhwa ani ni Dilao kaghu kahali Mhinya kaghu naamuonhi kune masame, na kune mudumuwa muboiane sacho nimuboiie. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Nimuaije to, kalo na kune muboiiane sakigi nimuboie kune. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Kweri nitamubaia ite, vanyamalo sivagiru kutakho hu vevanyamarikia, neri vazasughawa sivagiru kutakho hu vevasughae. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Kwato kai mukuila ya mburi, Kiumbi enemuboi makulho mukuyaboi. <verse eid="JHN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />Simuyoiya kune vakhabuna, mira hu ni valhoje nirevaila. Mira ro magondo ya Kiumbi yafuru sakigi yeyo, hu ea viaghu gho akhwa mkusa gho. <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Ani nimubaia ya mburi waijiji jisinalijanya, kalo jikunelijanya, mudarishe ite Ani Niu. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Kweri nitamubaia, kira emdoria hu enisughae enidoria ani. Kira enidoria ani emdoria hu enisughae.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etarota muhe enemkherii</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Matayo 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mariko 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luka 22:21-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Yesu erefi kuyo to, ekahiri swaho, ekayo ekaba “Kweri nimuba, muwe kaghu enenikherii!” <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Vahina vekawesiana mira teveekuila ite Yesu emyoiya ji. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Mhina muwe hehu vahina, hu eekudumuishwa ni Yesu, ezokhodie sina ne Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simoni Petro ekamkairia mharegha ekaba, “Mlhasu ite emyoia ji.” <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Ka mhina eaha sina ne Yesu, ekamlhasu, “Dilao, umyoiya ji?” <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu ekaba, “Nihu nnemuo kikhao cha mkate nikurafi kuginha he kikhonho.” Kwato ekadori kikhao cha mkate ekachiginha he kikhonho, ekamuo Yuda, muinyi wakwe Simoni Isikarioti. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Yuda areaa bi ka kikhao cha mkate, Shetani ekambuu. Kwato Yesu ekamba Yuda, “Kigi udumu kuboi chiboi nakawe.” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Mira hu veezokhodie to tehelo neri muwe eilie kwakhoni Yesu eeyoe to. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Kwaite Yuda neeu eekutii ibegi la mihaku, vahina vakuwe veeilie ite Yesu etemba erewe vigi vyekudumuwa he elha, hile arevao kigi vahuye. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Yuda arefi bi kua hu kikhao cha mkate, ekamangali gahana . Nee madamo ya naama.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miku kuale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Yuda arehali, Yesu ekaba, “Iji Muinyi wa Muhe aowe ugiru kuu wa kweri, Kiumbi nau aowe ugiru kuu wa kweri heka Muinyi. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Kwaite Muinyi aaija ugiru wa Kiumbi, Kiumbi nau eneaija ugiru wa Muinyi naho Kiumbi eneuaija ugiru wa Muinyi nakawe. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Vainyi gho, niaha na kune kwa madamo maghere. Munenidaa, mira iji nitamubaia hu nivabaie vagiru va Vayahudi, ite, hodi niso ani kune temumuru kuso. <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Nitamuo miku kuale, dumuanani. Sa kigi nimudumue kune, kwato na kune, mudumuane . <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Kai mukudumuana, vahe vakhabuna veneila ite kune muvahina gho.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etayo ite Petro enemlhi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mariko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simoni Petro ekamlhasu Yesu, “Dilao uso le?” Yesu ekamba, “Hodi niso ani tumuru kuniliaha waijiji, mira uneniliaha madamo elitie.” <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Petro ekamba, “Dilao, kwaahoni iji simuru kukuliaha waijiji? Nikeba nilhahati uzime gho kwa mburi ya ari.” <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu ekamba, “Ho kweri umuru kuga kwa mburi ya ani? Kweri nitakubaia, nkuruve isinaba kuzo unekhwa unenilhi kagi khai.”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu niu kwalhi ya kuso hakwe Kiumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesu eevabae, “Musibughenu he swaho kaghu, kai mumdarisha Kiumbi, nidarishani na ani wato. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Ang'a hakwe Aba gho helo hakuzoko hakumure. Kai sito sesemubaie ite nitaso kuramuboia kikulho hakuzokho. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Naho nikufi kumuboia hodi hakuzoko, ninekhwaa kumudori kalo mukhwa hawe na ani to hodi niaha. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Kune mureila kwalhi iso are hodi niso.” <verse eid="JHN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomaso ekamlhasu, “Dilao, tetuilie hodi uso, tunemuru kimomo iji kuila ka kwalhi ya kuhe are?” <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu ekamba, “Ani ni kwalhi, na kweri na uzime. Tehelo emuru kuso hakwe Aba ekusekaetiwe ni ani. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Kai muniilie ani, munemuila ne Aba gho. Kulholhoshia waijiji muremuila Aba, kahali mwafi kumuakho.” <verse eid="JHN 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filipo ekamba, “Dilao, tuaije Aba ata niho swaho kanu jinetaa.” <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu ekamba, “ Filipo nazokho na kune madamo makhabuna mira tuniilie? Muhe eniakhoe ani amuakho ne Aba. Umuru kimomo iji kuba, tuaije Aba?” <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Ho, tudarisha ite ani niaha za he Aba ne Aba nau eaha za gho? Viome nimubaia sivigho mira Aba ezokho za gho niu eboi ya nyamalo. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Mudumuwa kudarisha nikuba ite ani niaha za he Aba, Aba nau eaha za gho. Kai sito, nidarishani kwa lhaa mujiakhoe. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Kweri nitamubaia, hu venidarisha veneboi nyamalo nijiboi ani, kahali veneboi nyamalo giru kutakho ya, kwaite ani nitaso he Aba. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Kira kigi munelhawa chiaha he midumuire gho, ninemuo kalo Aba agimbikwe kutakhoia Muinyi kuu. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Kai mkunilhawa chiaha he midumuire gho, ninechiboi.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saa wa Kiumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />“Kai munidumu munedara miku gho. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Ninemlhawa Aba nau enemuo Mzalhaari mhali, enezokho na kune maaze makhabuna. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Ka ni Saa wa Kiumbi enemuaija ukweri. Hu vahe va idi tevemuru kumdarisha kwaite tevemuru kumuakho neri kumuila. Mira kune muremuila kwaite ezokho na kune nau eaha he swaho kaghu. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Nikuso, sikamuro sa vainyi vahuye, ninekhwaa kahali. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Hemerisie madamo maghere idi telikaniakho kahali, mira kune muneniakho, kwaite ani nilo uzime na kune munekhwa na uzime. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Ka muaze ukuhe muneila ite ani niaha za he Aba, na kune muaha za gho, na ani za kaghu. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Kira muhe edarisha miku gho nakujidara, ka niu enidumu. Naka enidumu ani enedumuwa ni Aba gho, na ani ninemdumu na kukuaija heu.” <verse eid="JHN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Niho Yuda mhali, sihu Yuda Isikarioti ekamba, “Dilao, kwaakhoni utubaiya ite unekuaija he nne naho si he vahe va idi?” <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu ekamba, Vahe vekunidumu venedara mahinyo gho, Aba gho nau enevadumu, naho ani ne Aba tunebale tuzokho navo. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Esinidumu tedara mahinyo gho. Naka mahinyo muakoie simagho, mira ni mahinyo yakwe Aba enisughae. <verse eid="JHN 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Nimubaie ya mburi madamo nicheri aha hawe na kune. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Mira ka Mzalhaari, niu Saa wa Kiumbi enesughawe ni Aba kutakhoia mburi gho, enemuhinya kira kigi na ekumuhulhati vikhabuna nimubaie. <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Nitamuroiya nhunguru gho, ya nhunguru gho nimuroia teitoe nahu nhunguru muowa ni idi. Musihiri he swaho kaghu neri musibughenu. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Mwenikoie niremuba, Nitaso, mira ninekhwaa kahali he kune. Kai mweenidumue, mweseelhamuiwe kwaite nitaso hakwe Aba, ake u ni mgiru kutakho ani. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Nimubaie to waijiji esinaba kulijanya, kalo ekunelijanya mumuru kudarisha. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Sikayo na kune mburi kumure, kwaite Shetani, mgiru waya idi elitie. Mira telo umuruisho he ani, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />mira vahe va idi vedumuwa vaile ite, nimdumue Aba, niu chiro niboi sa kigi Aba eniaji. Iji umani tuhali ii.<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu niu mzabibu wa kweri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />Yesu ekavaba, Ani niu mzabibu wa kweri, na Aba gho niu mkurume. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Kira itambi liaha za gho lisisa matunda u etalite, nahu itambi lisa matunda etaliboia kikulho kalo lisa matunda makumure. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Kune mwaafi kukhwari kikulho na ani kwamburi yahu mahinyo nimuhinyie. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Zokhoni za gho, na ani nizokho za kaghu. Sahu kigi itambi la mzabibu telimuru kusa matunda wangalo likusekhwa he mzabibu, wato oto kune temumuru kusa matunda mukusezokho za gho. <verse eid="JHN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Ani ni mkhatu wa mzabibu, nakune mumatambi. Efufu za gho, na ani nikukhwa za hakuu, ka enesa matunda makumure, kwaite nesiaha ani mkhatu wa mzabibu, kune temumuru kuboi kigi. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Muhe neri muwe ekusaazokho za gho u etoe sa itambi libibiwe gahana na kuhala, matambi yekuhala yetabunguruwe na kubibiwe he mwalha na kulhaha. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Mukufufu za gho na viome gho vikufufu za kaghu, lhawani kira kigi mudumu na kune munechiowe. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Kune mukusa matunda makumure, Aba gho enegimbikwa, kwa kwali ya ineaija ite kune muvahina gho. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Ani nimudumue kune sahu kigi Aba enidumue ani. Zokhoni he ludumuisho gho. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Kai munedara miku gho, munezokho he ludumuisho gho, sahu kigi ani nidarie miku yakwe Aba gho na kuzokho he ludumuisho kuu. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Nimubaie ya mburi kalo mulhamuiwe sakigi ani nilhamuiwa, naho kulhamuiwa kaghu kufuru. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Miku gho niu ya, dumuanani, sa kigi ani nimudumue kune. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Tehelo ludumusho lugirusha kutakho ya ludumuisho, lwa muhe egu uzime kuu kwa mburi ya vasaho kuu. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Kune mwaakhwa vasaho gho kai mukuboi vyo nimubaia. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Kune simuse vanyamalo kahali, kwaite vahaye teila kigi chiboiwa ni dilao kuu. Mira nimusee kune vasaho kwaite namubaia mburi khabuna nijikoie kuli he Aba gho. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Kune temunilhoije ani, mira niani nimulhoije kune, mukhwa vahina gho, neemulhoje muso muresa matunda, matunda yesionika, kwato kira kigi munemlhawa Aba sacho edumu enemuo. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Kwato, miku nimuo niu ya, mudumuane.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vahe va idi vetavasanuia vahina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />Vahe va idi vesinamusanuiwa kune, muhulha ite veelholhoshie kunisanuia ani. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Kai mwe vahe vaidi, vahe idi vesemudumue kune sacho vevadumu vahe kini. Mira kune temuvahe va idi, kwaite nitemulhoja kune kuli he idi kalo mukhwa vahe gho, niu chiro idi limusanuiwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Hulhani hucho nimubaie, Mnyamalo si mgiru kutakho dilao kuu. Ikukhwa veenikharotije ani, venemukharotija na kune. Kai veedarie mahinyo gho, venedara na mahinyo kaghu. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Mira venemuboia ka makhabuna kwaite kune muboi hucho niboi, veneboi to kwaite tevemuilie hu enisughae. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Kai seelitie nikayo navo tevesekhwae na makusa, mira iji tevemuru kukuyoia ite tevelo makusa. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Muhe enisanuia ani, emsanuia ne Aba gho. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Kai ani seeboie hakini vimako visiboiwe ni muhe mhali hevo, teveseekhwa na makusa. Mira iji vaakho vyo niboie naho vecheri nisanuia ani ne Aba gho. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Ya makhabuna yeliijanye kalo Magondo ya Kiumbi yeba, Vaanisanuiwa bule Yafuru. <verse eid="JHN 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />Ekuralita ka Mzalhaari nnemsugha he kune kuli hakwe Aba, ka Swaho eajia ukweri wa Kiumbi, u enemubaia yo eailie he ani. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Na kune munevabaia vahe yo muilie kuli he ani, kwaite mweaha hawe na ani kuli bosi.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />Yesu ekakhwa echeri yo ekuba, Nimubaie to kalo kudarisha kaghu musikuro. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Vagiru va minda ja kusahea Vayahudi tevekamudumuije kuboi nyamalo kaghu ata, kahali madamo elitie hu vemugaa kune venetoti ite vekuboi to vetamnyamarikia Kiumbi. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Ka vahe veneboi to kwaite tevemuilie Aba neri teveniilie ani. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Mira nimubaie to kalo ka madamo ekurahe muhulha ite namubaiyaa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Nyamalo ya Saa wa Kiumbi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">Simubaie ya mburi kuli azeto, kwaite neecheri aha hawe na kune. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Mira iji nitaso hehu enisughae, naho tehelo neri muwe enilhasu Uso le? <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Swaho kaghu jaabuwe ni vuhuye kwaite naamubaiya ka mburi. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Ukweri ni ite, inekhwa kikulho he kune ani nikuso, kwaite kai sikaso, Mzalhaari tekalita hakaghu. Mira kai nineso, nnemsugha hakaghu. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Nau ekuralita ka Mzalhaari enevaaija vahe va idi vaile mburi ya makusa kinii, naho enevaaija mburi ya kudumuika kini he Kiumbi na mburi ya kuzamariwa kini. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Ka mzalhaari enevaaija vahe ite velo makusa kwaite tevenidarishe ani, <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />enemuaija ite ani nidumuika he Kiumbi kwato nitaso he Aba, naho temukaniakho kahali, <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />kwa mburi ya zamaro, kwaite Shetani emgiru waya idi afi kuzamariwa ni Kiumbi. <verse eid="JHN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“Nicheri lo makumure yakumubaiya, mira waijiji temukaamuru kuyaila. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Mira ekuralita ka Saa eaija ukweri wa Kiumbi niu enemukaeti na kumuhinya ukweri mkhabuna, kwaite tekamuhinye mburi kuu salaghe, mira enemuhinya hu makhabuna eyakoia kuli hagho nau enemubaiya mburi jinelijanya kalufunda. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Ka Saa eaija ukweri wa Kiumbi eneniko ani kikulho kwaite enedoria huvyo niayo naho enemubaiya kune. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Vigi vikabuna Aba elo navyo ni vigho, niuchiro niba ite ka Saa enedoria mahinyo gho na kumubaia kune.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vuhuye vutakirii kukhwa mlhamuisho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Yesu ekavaba vahina kuu, hemerisie madamo maghere temukaniaho, naho kalufunda kahali muneniakho.” <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Niho vahina kuu vakuwe vekalhasuana vekuba, “Etotie kiakhoni ekuba, hemerisie madamo maghere temukaniaho, naho ekuba madamo maghere kalufunda muneniaho? Naho ekuba, kwaite nitaso he Aba?” <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Vekacheri velhasuana, etotie kiakhoni ekuba, hemerisie madamo maghere? Tetuila ite eyo kiakhoni. <verse eid="JHN 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu ekaila ite vedumu vamlhasu mburi ya ka viome, kwato ekavaba, “He mutalhasuana hu mburi niyoiye, hemerisie madamo maghere temukaniaho, naho hekunetaho madamo maghere muneniaho? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Nitamuabai ukweri, kune munezo malima nakuhuyeti mira idi linelhamuiwa. Munehuyeti mira kuhuyeti kaghu kunekirii kulhamuiwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Mlage ekusa muinyi etalhaishishwa kwaite madamo kuu yakuakho yaahe, mira ekufiriti kuakho muinyi tehulha kahali kuhiri, kwa mburi ya kulhamuiwa ite aamgera muhe muhali he idi. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Iji kune mwaahiri swaho, mira ninemuakho kahali, munelhamuiwa he swaho kaghu, tehelo muhe enelakha mlhamuisho kaghu. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Heka muaze ukunehe neri temulo kiome munenilhasu. Nitamubaiya kweri, kira kigi munemlhawa Aba kwa ugiru gho enemuo. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Sari waijiji temunalhawa kigi kwa ugiru gho. Lhawani na kune muneowe kalo kulhamuiwa kaghu kufuru.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aalimuru idi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Nimubaiye ka mburi kwa mitotire. Mira madamo elitie sikayo kwa mitotire kahali, mira ninemubaiya ka mburi jakwe Aba neri kumatu. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Muaze ka munemlhawa Aba kwa ugiru gho, naho sikamubaiye ite ninemlhawa Aba kwa mburi kaghu, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />kwaite Aba salaghe eramudumu kune, kwaite kune muranidumu ani naho mwaadarisha ite nilie he Kiumbi. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Ani neelie hakwe Aba nikalita he idi, iji nitahali he idi, nitaso hakwe Aba.” <verse eid="JHN 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Niho vahina kuu vekamba, “Waijiji uyo neri kumatu, neri tuyo kwa mitotire. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Kwato twaaile ite ari uilie mburi khabuna naho tetukakulhasu kahali. Kwaya mburi tudarisha ite ari weelie he Kiumbi.” <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu ekavaba, “Ho waijiji munidarisha? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Kwato madamo elitie, kahali afi kuhe, kune vakhabuna muneparaa munegale kira muwe hakuu, ani ninerowa salaghe. Mira ani siaha salaghe, kwaite Aba eaha hawe na ani. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Nimubaiye ya mburi, kalo mukhwa na nhunguru. Heya idi muneakho kharo, mira kuoni swaho, kwaite ani nalimuru idi.”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etavaaresia vahina kuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesu erefiriti kuyo to, ekawesia ana he Kiumbi ekaba, “Aba madamo gho yaahe, aija ugiru wa Muinyi kechi kalo Muinyi nau avaaije ugiru kechi. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Kwaite Aba um'oe Muinyi ugiru he vahe vakhabuna huvo um'oe, kalo avao uzime wa maaze makhabuna huvo umuoe. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Uzime wa maaze makhabuna niu ya, vahe vakuile ite ari ni Kiumbi wa kweri uaha salaghe, naho vaniile Yesu Masia unisughaye. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Naakugimbika heya idi, kwa kuifiriti hu nyamalo unisughaye niboi. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Aba nikulhawa unio ugiru hu neelo nawo madamo neaha naari idi lesinaba. <verse eid="JHN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />Navaaija hu vahe wenioe kuli he idi cho utoe. Nee vahe kechi na ari ukavanio ani vakhwa vagho, navo vaaboi hucho uvabae vaboi. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Kwato vaile ite vikhabuna unioe vilie ha kechi, <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />kwaite hu unibaiye navahinya, navo vaavidoria, kahali vaile ite kweri nilie he ari, naho vaadarisha ite ari niu unisughae. <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Nivaaresia vo. sivaaresia vahe vesinidarisha, mira nivaaresia huvo unioe, kwaite ka nivahe kechi. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Vahe gho vakhabuna nivakechi na vahe kechi ni vahe gho, naani naaowe ugiru kwa mburi ya mifufure kini. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Ani siaha kahali he idi, mira vo vecheri aha he idi, naani nitalita he ari. Aba ufurue salaghe, ya vahe unioe uvalaaru kwa umuruisho ulo nau, kalo vakhwa kigi kiwe sa kigi nne cho tukigi kiwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Madamo neaha navo, neevalaarue kwa kuvabaia hu ukweri unioe wa mitore kechi. Neevalaarue vasidarwe ni ukusa, simlahatie neri muwe kuro bi hu ekeiwe kuoniwa, kalo yalijanye hu magondo ya Kiumbi yegondiwe ite yamlijanyie. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Iji nitalita hakechi, mira nirayo viome ya nikukhwa nicheri aha he ya idi, kalo vakhwa na mlhamuisho ufurue sakigi ufurue ya mlhamuisho nilo nawo ani. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Ani naavahinya huyo udumue nivahinye, vahe va idi vekavasanuiya kwaite vo si vahe va idi, sahu kigi ani nisi muhe wa idi. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Sikulhawa ite uvagu he idi, mira nikulhawa uvake uda nahu mkusa Shetani. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Vo si vahe vaya idi, sahu kigi ani nisiwaidi. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Nikulhawa uvaboi vakhwa vahe kechi kwa kwalhi ya ukweri, kwaite mahinyo kechi niya kweri. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Sahu kigi unisughae he vahe va idi, na ani nitavasugha ya vahe he vahe va idi. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Nitakuke kukunyamarikia ari kwa mburi kini kalo navo vakuke he ari kwa kwalhi ya kweri. <verse eid="JHN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />Sivaaresia waya bi, mira nivaaresia nahu vakhabuna venedarisha kutakhoiya viome venebaiwa niya venidarishe. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Niaresi kalo vakhabuna vakhwa kigi kiwe, sa kigi ari Aba! uaha za hagho na ani cho niaha za kechi, navo vakhwa za kanu, kalo vahe va idi vadarishe ite ari niu unisughae. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Ani nivaoe ugiru sahu unioe ani, kalo vakhwa kigi kiwe sa kigi ari na ani tuaha kigi kiwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Ani nikhwa za kini, sa kigi ari uaha za gho, kalo swaho kini jiisekoishe, niho vahe va idi veneile ite ani nilie he ari, naho uvadumue sa kigi unidumue ani. <verse eid="JHN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />Aba, kise gho ni ite hu vahe unioe vakhwa hawe na ani to ninekhwa, kalo vamuru kuakho lugimbiko lugiru na luatame gho unioe, kwaite weenidumue kuli idi leesihaaha. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Aba Mzalo Ukweri, neri ite vahe va idi tevekuilie, mira ani nikuilie. Ya navo vereile ite ni ari unisughae. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Naavaaija kigi utoe, naho nineraboi to, kalo ludumuisho kechi ulo nau he ani ukhwa za kini, naho ani nikhwa za kini.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etadarawe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mariko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yesu arefiriti kumlhawa Kiumbi, ekatakho hawe na vahina kuu bwa wa kanu wa kaseu kesewa Kedroni. Vekabuu he mbuva ya mikhatu ya mizeituni. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yuda, enemkirii Yesu eerehaile to hodi kwaite Yesu eemanyere kusahe ata na vahina kuu kira madamo . <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Kwato, Yuda ekalita he mbuva ya mikhatu ya mizeituni. ekukhwa ekaetijane na vaaku va Kirumi, vakilaaru va minda ya Kiumbi veesughaiwe ni vagiru va Muaresi na Mafarisayo, navo veedarae vijari, vibune vilo mwalha na vigi vya aku. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Niho Yesu ekuile makhabuna yenemlianyija, ekakuguanya hevo ekavalhasu, “Mumdaa ji?” <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Navo vekamba, “Tumdaa Yesu kuli Nazareti” Yesu ekavaba, “Niu ani.” Yuda enemkirii Yesu nau eeumae hawe naka vahe. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Yesu areavaba, “Niu ani,” vekakhwaa mzungure, na kulhu di. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Yesu ekavalhasu kahali, “Mumdaa ji?” Vekamba, “Yesu kuli Nazareti!” <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu ekavaba, “Naamubaiyaa ite ani niu, kwato kai munidaa ani, varoni ya vaso kini. <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Eeyoe to kalo hu viome vyo eeyoe vifuru, simlahatie neri mhe muwe he hu unioe.” <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Niho Simoni esewa Petro eelo sime ekaigu naho ekampaa ilama la sughano hu mhaye wa mgiru wa muaresi. Ka mhaye eekusewa Malko. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Yesu ekamba Petro, “Re sime kechi he iala. Ho, utoti ite siye kudoria kharo jo Aba gho edumu nijitakhoiye?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etatiiwe hakwe Anasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Niho hu vaaku na vagiru kini na vakilaaru va Minda ya Kiumbi, vekamdara Yesu vekam'oro. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Mgiru wa bosi ho vemtiiye Yesu nee Anasi. Anasi nee mkora wa kiagiru wakwe Kayafa. Kayafa neeu mgiru wa muaresi heka mko. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Kayafa neeu eevaajie Vayahudi ite chidumuwa muhe muwe aga kwa mburi ya vahe vakhabuna.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petro etamlhi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Matayo 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mariko 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luka 22:55-57</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoni Petro hawe na mhina mhali vekamliaha Yesu. Kwaite ka mhina mhali eekuiliana na mgiru wa muaresi, kwato ekabuu hawe ne Yesu za he kivanda chiaha zaya lugo lwa minda ya mgiru wa muaresi. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Mira Petro eeumaye gahana sina na luhige lwa kubuuya he kivanda, kwato hu mhina mhali veeiliane na mgiru wa muaresi ekali gahana ekayo na mualeta nee mkilaaru he luhige, ekamdumuija Petro abuu za. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Ka mualeta ekamlhasu Petro, “Ho, na ari u muwe wa vahina va ya muhe?” Petro ekamba, “Hai ani si mhina kuu” <verse eid="JHN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Ka nee madamo ya saa vahaye na vakilaaru veekhaije mwalha wa makale navo veujunguluke vekukakati, Petro nau eeumaye hawe navo ekukakati.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mgiru wa muaresi etamlhasu Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matayo 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mariko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luka 22:66-71</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Niho Anasi hu eekhwae mgiru wa muaresi ekamlhasu Yesu mburi ya vahina kuu na mahinyo kuu. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu ekamba, “Neekuhinya lheme mbele ja vahe vakhabuna, kira madamo neekuhinya hakusahea Vayahudi na he Minda ya Kiumbi, hodi ho Vayahudi vesahea. Tehelo kigi cho nihinyie kwa kumatu. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Kwakhoni unilhasu? Valhasu hu vekoie ka mahinyo ite nivabae mo. Vo vereila cho nivabaiye.” <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Areafiriti kuyo to mkilaaru muwe eumae hesina nau ekamma izoghera ekaba, “Ka nicho umuru kumba mgiru wa muaresi?” <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu ekamba, “Kai niyoe kigi chisiye kuyo, chiyo he vahe, mira kai niyoe kweri kwakhoni unima?” <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Niho Anasi ekamtii Yesu he mgiru wa muaresi esewa Kayafa, Yesu ekukhwa erecheri orowe mulhu.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petro etamlhi Yesu kahali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Matayo 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mariko 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luka 22:58-62</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />He ka madamo Petro eumae ekakati mwalha nahu vahe vekumlhasu, “Ho, ari sire muwe wa vahina kuu?” Petro ekalhi ekuba, “Hai ani si muwe kini” <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Mnyamalo muwe wa mgiru wa muaresi, mbahu wahu eteiwe ilama ni Petro, ekamlhasu, “Ho, sikuahoe ari hawe ne Yesu twai he mbuva ya mikhatu ya mizeituni?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Petro ekalhi kahali, wato to ikuruve likazo.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etatiiwa he Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayo 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mariko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Madamo ka he kutalholhoshi kulhe, niho vekamdori Yesu kuli hakwe Kayafa vekamtii he iminda la kidilao lakwe Pilato ee dilao wa Varumi mira Vayahudi tevebuiye za kalo vamuru kudumuijwa he miku ya kumuaresi Kiumbi, naho vamuru kua viaghu vya Pasaka. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Kwato Pilato ekali gahana ekavalhasu, “Mulo maoghe mina naya muhe?” <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Vekamba, “Kai ya muhe see mzaboi makusa, tetwesee mgera he ari.” <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilato ekavaba, “Haya mdorini wa kune muremzamari kuli he miku kaghu.”Vayahudi vekamba, “Nne tetudumuijwa kumzamari muhe kigame neri muwe.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Cheeboike to kalo vilianye viome Yesu eeyoe kuaija ite enega kigame mina. <verse eid="JHN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Kwato Pilato ekabuu kahali he iminda ya kidilao ekamse Yesu ekamlhasu, “Ai ari niu dilao wa Vayahudi?” <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu ekamlhasu, “Ho, ari uyo to kwa mitotire kechi hile vahe vahali vetekubaiya mburi gho?” <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilato nau ekamlhasu, “ Ho, ani ni Myahudi? Vahe kechi na vagiru va muaresi vetekugera he ani. Ho, uonie kigi mina?” <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu ekamba, “Udilao gho teuaha heya idi. Kai udilao gho ne waya idi, vahe gho veniliaha veseenilhaari nisibutuwe he miharegha ya Vayahudi. Mira iji udilao gho teuli he ya idi. <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Pilato ekamlhasu, kwato ari udilao?” Yesu ekamba, “Niari uyoe ite ani nidilao. Ani niakhoike na kulita he ya idi kwaka mburi we bi, kalo nimubaiye ukweri. Kira muhe edumu ukweri ereile ite yo niyo niya kweri.” <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilato ekamlhasu, “Ukweri ni kigi mina?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Yesu etazamariwa kuga</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Matayo 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mariko 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:15-25">Luka 23:15-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Pilato arefiriti kuyo to, ekali gahana kuvaliaha Vayahudi, ekavaba, “Ani siaho kigi eonie ya muhe. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Mira kune muraboii to ite kira madamo ya elha ya Pasaka mumgu muhe muwe eeorowe. Ho, mudumu nimmgu Dilao wa Vayahudi?” <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Niho vekayo kwa kuma gimbe vekuba, “Hai siu, tumdumu Baraba!” Ka Baraba nee mzala.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Kwato Pilato ekamgu Yesu ekaba ite amawe ndate ja bulhe. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Vaaku navo vekadori milhae vekaboi nkofia saya kidilao vekamuoro he mua, naho vekam'oro gomae ya kidilao ibayu. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Vekakhwa vetaso kakumure to hodi eaha vekumholu kwa kumfwa vekumba, “Tukuholu, Dilao wa Vayahudi!” Ilai vekumma mazokhera he vubasa. <verse eid="JHN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilato ekali kahali gahana, ekavaba Vayahudi, “Wesiani nitamugeria ya muhe kahali, kalo muakho ite ani siakhoe cho eonie. <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Kwato, Yesu ekali gahana eoroe he mua hu nkofia saya kidilao na gomae ibayu ya kidilao. Pilato ekavaba, wesiani, muhe mumdaa niu ya!” <verse eid="JHN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Vagiru va muaresi na vakilaaru va Minda ya Kiumbi varemuakho vekama gimbe vekuba, “Mkharotini, mkharotini!” Pilato ekavaba, mdorini wakune muremkharoti, kwaite ani siakhoe cho eonie. <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Vayahudi vekamba “Nne tulo miku, kutahoia heka miku, chidumuwe aga, kwaite etekuse ite u ni Muinyi wa Kiumbi.” <verse eid="JHN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pilato areko ka mburi, ekabughenusha. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Kwato ekabuu kahali he iminda la kidilao, Ekamlhasu Yesu, nile hodi elie. Mira Yesu tembaie kigi. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Kwato Pilato ekamba, “Ari utalhi kuyo na ani? Ho, tuilie ite nilo ugiru wa kukulhamera hile kukukharoti?” <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesu ekamba,“Tweseekhwa naka ugiru, kai Kiumbi teekuoe. Kwato, hu enigerie he ari elo makusa magirusha.” <verse eid="JHN 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Kulholhoshia to Pilato ekadaa kwalhi yakumlhamera Yesu, mira Vayahudi vekama gimbe vekuba, “Ukumlhamera ya muhe, ari tumsaho wakwe Kaisari. Kira muhe ekuboi ni dilao etamsanuia Kaisari!” <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Kwato Pilato ereako ka viome, ekamgu Yesu gahana, ekazokhodi he kikire kuu cha kuzamaria chiaha hodi heboiiwe na masaheru Kiebrania hesewe Gabata. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Madamo ka nee kela tizu hachakako muaze wa elha ya Pasaka. Pilato ekavaba Vayahudi, “Yaaye ii Dilao kaghu!” <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Mira vekama gimbe vekuba, “Mgaa! Mgaa! Mkharotije he msaraba!” Pilato ekavalhasu, “Nimkharotije he msaraba Dilao kaghu?” Vagiru va muaresi vekaba, “Dilao kanu ni Kaisari bi tetulo mhali!” <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Kwato Pilato ekamuotija Yesu he miharegha kini kalo akharotijwe.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesu etakharotijwa he msaraba</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mariko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Kwato vakilaaru vekamdori Yesu nakuso nau. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Yesu ekali etiie msaraba kuu ekaso hodi hesewa “Ifwara la Mua” Kiebrania lisewa Goligota. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Vareahe ata hodi vekamkharotija he msaraba hawe na vahe vahali vanu, muwe bwa wa sughano na mhali bwa wa hina. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilato ekaba hagondwe magondo he kibala chikewe ana he msaraba. Ka magondo yeegondiwe to, “Yesu wa Nazareti, Dilao wa Vayahudi.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Ka magondo yeegondiwe kwa Kieburania na kilatini na Kigiriki, Vayahudi vakumure veeyasomie ka magondo, kwaite ata hodi Yesu eekharotijwe nee sina nahe muang'a. Kahaliwa ka magondo yeegondiwe kwa Kieburania na kilatini na Kigiriki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Kwato vagiru va muaresi vekamba Pilato “ Usigonde, Dilao wa Vayahudi, mira ugonde ite ya muhe ebae, Ani ni Dilao wa Vayahudi.” <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilato ekavaba “Cho nigondie naagonda!” <verse eid="JHN 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Vaaku vareafiriti kumkharotija, vekadori gomae kuu, vekajikakaanya mafumbe mahai, kira m'aku ekadori ifumbe iwe. Vekadori na nkazu kuu ya za, ka nkazu yeehiiwe na kitambala kiwe kuli ana sari di. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Kwato vaaku vekabayana, “Tusiikhaa, mira tuimie simbi ite inekhwa ya kweji.” Ka mburi yeboiike kalo Mogondo ya Kiumbi yalijanye yeba, “Veekakaane gomae gho, kahali na nkazu gho vekaimaya simbi.” Niu kigi veboie ka vaaku. <verse eid="JHN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Sina na msaraba wakwe Yesu veeumae lage kuu, na lage mgiru wakwe Yesu ne Maria mlage wakwe Kleopa ne Maria kuli Magidala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yesu areamuakho lage kini eumae sina nahu mhina ekumdumuisha, ekamba lage kini “Lage, ka iji niu muinyi kechi.” <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Naho ekamba hu mhina , “Ka niu lage kechi.” Kulholhoshia to ka mhina ekagale ne alhii Yesu arezokho nau ang'a kuu.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etaga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mariko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Yesu areakho nyamalo kuu yaaboiika, kalo Magondo ya Kiumbi yafuru, ekaba, “Nitako kasu.” <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Ata heelo ibakuri lihuwe divai ikala. Vekadori kikhao cha ighodoro vekachibutu heka divai , vekachitunga he ndate kulhe ya mkhatu usewa isopo vekachikaa ana, vekamkeia he muo. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yesu areafi kugali ka divai ekaba, “Nyamalo gho yaakhita.” Ekadudukhuja mua ekapaa swaho ekaga.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etatungwa iguha he lunabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Nee muaze wa kuke kikulo Muaze wa kusaaboi nyamalo, Vayahudi tevekudumu misa ikhwa he misaraba he Muaze wa kusaaboi nyamalo naho wato ka muaze weekulhuiya he elha ya Pasaka. Kwato Vayahudi vekamlhawa Pilato ite masame yaka vekharotijwe ipuwe kalo vamange ga naho misa kini ikaawe he misaraba. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Niho vaaku vekaso, vekapu masame ya muhe wa bosi nawa kanu ka vekharotijwe kakera he Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Mira vareahe he Yesu, vekaakho ite afi kuga, kwato tevempue masame. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Mira muaku muwe ekambovora na iguha he lunabo, wato oto sako na mai vikali he msa kuu. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Muhe eakhoe ka mburi eyoe yo eakhoe kalo mumuru kudarisha. Mburi yo eakhoe niya kweri naho ereile it cho emubaiya nichakweri. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Ka mburi jeeboiike kalo magondo ya Kiumbi yafuru yeba, “Tehelo neri ifwara kuu linepuika.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Magondo ya Kiumbi mahali eba, “Venemuwesia hu vembovore.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etakewa he mbira</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mariko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Ka mburi jiretakho, Yosefu wa Arimataya, ee mhina wakwe Yesu, mira eekumliaha kwakukumatu kwaite eekuvabugheno Vayahudi, ekamgogo Pilato kalo aukae msa wakwe Yesu. Pilato ekamdumuija, kwato ekaso ekaukaa. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Ka Nikodemo, hu eemliahie Yesu naama, ekalita edarie malhoma ya mihaku mikumure yesewe manemane yekhwariiwe na ubani elo kiro mikado mikai. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Kwato ka vahe vanu vekaudori msa wakwe Yesu, vekaulhomi malhoma yesumu kikulho vekauoro sanda sacho yekhwae miku ya Vayahudi ya kuke he mbira. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Ata hodi Yesu ekharotijwe, heelo kabuva ka mikhatu ya mizabibu naata heka kabuva heelo mbira kuale yeesinaba kukeiwa msa wa muhe. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Kwaite nee madamo ya kuke kikulho mburi ja Muaze wa kusaaboi nyamalo, naka mbira yeeaha sina, vekauke msa wakwe Yesu ata.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Yesu aaka kuli he kigame</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mariko 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Muaze wa bosi ijuma hachalhenu chalhenu, hecheri lo kidughu, Maria kuli Magidala ekahe he mbira, ekaakho hu isaheru lakaiwa he luhige lwa mbira. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Niho, ekagugulu nakawe sari he Simoni Petro nahu mhina mhali hu eedumuishwe ni Yesu ekavaba, “Vaakaa msa wakwe Dilao he mbira, naho tetuilie hodi vemtiie.” <verse eid="JHN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Niho Petro nahu mhina mhali vekali vekaso he mbira. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Vakhabuna vanu veekugugulu, mira hu mhina mhali egugulu kumtakho Petro, ekakae kuhe he mbira. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Areahe ekadudukhu ekawesia to za he mbira, ekaakho sanda mira tebuiye za. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Simoni Petro nau ekahe ekabuu he mbira, ekaheiya sanda bi to za he mbira, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />ekaakho nahu kitambara cho Yesu eeorowe he mua. Ka kitambara techekeiwe hawe naka sanda, mira chefunduwe chikakewa hodi kuu. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Nahu mhina mhali ekaee kuhe he mbira, nau ekabuu za, ekaakho ekadarisha. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Kwaite teveenaba kuila ite ya Magondo ya Kiumbi yeba ite chidumuwe Yesu aka kuli he kigame. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Niho ka vahina vekagale.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etamlijanyia Maria wa Magidala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matayo 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mariko 16:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Mira Maria ekafufu to he mbira gahana ekuzo. Ilai erazo, ekaduduku ekasungirija he mbira, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />ekaakho Vazasughawa vanu va are ana he Kiumbi veoroe gomae jiakhu, vezokodie to hodi msa wakwe Yesu webodijwe, muwe mlha wa mua weeaha mhali mlha wa he masame yeeaha. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Ka Vazasughawa va are ana he Kiumbi vekamlhasu, “Mlage, uzo ahoni?” Ekavaba, “Vaamkaa Dilao gho, naho siilie hodi vemtiie!” <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Areafiriti kuyo to, ekawesia mzungure ekamuakho Yesu eumae to, mira teilie ite ni Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu ekamlhasu, “Mlage, uzo akhoni? Umdaa ji?” Maria, ebae ni muhe eekuumaya he kaseu, ekamba, “Mgiru, kai helo hodi uuchiie ka msa, nibaya hodi umkee, naani nneso kuramdori.” <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu ekase ekaba, “Maria!” Maria nau ekamkheriia Yesu, ekambaiya kwa Kieburania, “Raboni” nikuba “Mhinya” <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu ekamba, “Usinidare, sinaba kuso ana hakwe Aba. Mira so he vabakhu gho urevaba, nitaso ana hakwe Aba gho naho ni Aba kaghu, Kiumbi gho, naho ni Kiumbi kaghu.” <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Niho Maria kuli Magidala ekaso hehu ekavabiya ite “Naamuaho Dilao” Naho ekavasimoreja mburi jo ebaiwe ni Yesu ambaia to.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavalianyija vahina kuu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mariko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Hareahe hachamagheri heka muaze wa bosi wa ijuma, vahina veesahee hawe za he minda. Navo veelhatie maluhige kwaite veekuvabughenu vagiru va Vayahudi. Yesu ekalijanya ekauma hehu vahina evaba “Nhunguru ikhwa na kune.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Areafi kuyo to, ekavaaija miharegha na lunabo kuu. Vahina kuu vekalhamuishishwa kumuakho Dilao. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu ekavaba kahali, “Nhunguru ikhwa na kune! Sakigi Aba enisughae ani, na ani nitamusugha kune.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Areafi kuyo to, ekavaufuia saa ekavaba, “Doriani Saa wa Kiumbi.” <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Mukumkaaiya muhe neri makusa kuu, ka muhe enekaaiwa ni Kiumbi, naho mukusemkaaiya muhe neri makusa kuu, tekakaaiwe makusa kuu ni Kiumbi.<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne etamliiya Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Tomasi, muwe wa hu vahina ikado na vanu, naho esewa Pacha, teeaha hawe nahu vahina madamo hu Yesu arevaliijanya. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Kwato hu vahina vahali vekamba “Twamuakho Dilao.” Mira Tomasi ekavaba, “Kai sikaakho mabalo ya misumari imawe he miharegha kuu nikubutu kisatu gho heka mabalo, nikusaabutu mharegha gho he lunabo kuu, sikadarishe ite niu.” <verse eid="JHN 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Miaze mnane iretakho ka vahina veaha hawe za hehu minda, Tomasi nau ereaha hawe navo. Neri ite maluhige yeelhatiwe, mira Yesu ekaliijanya ekauma hasihasi hevo, ekavaba, “Nhunguru ikhwa na kune.” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Ekamba Tomasi “Lita ubutu kisatu kechi ii he miharegha gho gera muharegha kechi uubutu he lunabo gho. Ro bughu, mira udarishe!” <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomasi ekamba, “Dilao gho naho ni Kiumbi gho.” <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yesu ekamlhasu, “Waadarisha kwaite waniakho? Vaaboiiwa makhulho hu vesiniakhoe mira vaanidarisha.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiroe ya kitabu chikagondwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesu eboie lhaa haliwa kumure vahina kuu vekajiakho mira tevigondiwe heya kitabu. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Mira ya lhaa jigondiwe kalo mumuru kudarisha ite Yesu niu Masia, Muinyi wa Kiumbi, mukudarisha to munekhwa na uzime wa maaze khabuna.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etavalijanyia vahina saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Areatakho ka, Yesu ekavalijanyia vahina kuu khakhera he iziwa lisewa Tiberia. Eevalijanyie to, <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />nee vahina vakuwe veebungurue hawe, Simoni Petro ne Tomasi eekusewa Pacha ne Natanaeli eekudi are Kana Galilaya, vamilo vanu vakwe Zebedayo na vahina kuu vahali vanu, veaha hawe vakhabuna. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoni Petro, eevabae, “Nitaso kuvulula samaki.” Navo veembae, “Nne tuneso hawe na ari.” Kwato veelie, vekakutu he mashua, mira heka kiama teveakhoe kigi neri. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Harealholhoshi kulhe, Yesu ekauma khakhera he iziwa, mira vahina tevemurue kuila ite niu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Niho Yesu ekavalhasu, “Vasaho gho, temuakhoe neri kigi?” Navo vekamba, “Ee” Tetuakhoe neri kigi. <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Yesu ekavaba, “Bibini nyavu mlha wa sughano wa mashua muneakho samaki.” Vekabibi nyavu heka mlha, vekadara samaki kumure, sari vekakwasiwa kukaa hu nyavu jilo samaki na kubutu ka samaki he mashua. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Hu mhina eekudumuishwa ni Yesu ekamba Petro, “Ni Dilao!” Simoni Petro areako ite ni Dilao ekaoro gomae kuu, kwaite teeoroe, nau ekapuru ekabuu za he mai. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Mira vahina vahali vekama makasia vaichii mashu he idi lisilo mai ilai vekhuru hu nyavu jeehue samaki sari khakhera ya iziwa, kwaite veaha uda wa meta igana iwe bi sari he idi lisilo mai. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Vareahe hodi hesilo mai vekaakho mwalha wa makale ukha na ata he makale ana heekeiwe samaki na mikate. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesu ekavaba, “Gerani samaki jakuwe jo muvulule waijiji.” <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simoni Petro ekakutu he mashua, ekakhuru hu lwavu luhuye samaki giru jirahe igana iwe mikhado mikoi na kai, sari hodi hesilo mai. Hawe na ite samaki nee kumure mira lwavu teupaae. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu ekavaba “ Litani tua viaghu.” Tehelo neri muwe egalie kumlhasu, “Ari uji?” kwaite vaaila ite ni Dilao. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yesu ekalita, ekadori mkate, ekavao, na wato oto ekavao nahu samaki. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Nee kagi ka kakai Yesu kuvalijanyia vahina kuu kuli to areka kuli he kigame.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etayo ne Petro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Varefiriti kua, Yesu ekamlhasu Simoni Petro “Simoni, muinyi wakwe Yohana!, unidumue ani kuro ya vahali?” Nau ekaba, “Dilao, ureile ite ani nikudumu.” Yesu ekamba, “Pasi maalu gho. <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Ekambaia ka kanu, Simoni muinyi wakwe Yohana! unidumu?” Petro ekamba, “Dilao, ureila ite nikudumu.” Yesu ekamba, “Wesiisha maalu gho.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Ekamlhasu ka kakai, “Simoni muinyi wakwe Yohana! unidumu?” Petro ekahiri swaho kwaite Yesu emlhasue ka kai ekuba ite, “Unidumu?” Petro ekamba “Dilao ari ureila makhabuna, ari ureila ite nikudumu.” Yesu ekamba, “Zeu maalu gho. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Nitakubaia ukweri, madamo hu wee mburatu weekuraoro msipi hasi hasi he msa nakuso hodi ho udumu. Mira ukukhwa muhe mzimesha muhe mhali enekuoro msipi hasi he msa kechi akutii hodi usidumu kuhaso.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Yesu eyoe viome ya kuaija ite ni kigame mina cho enega kalo kumgimbika Kiumbi. Niho ekamba “Niliaha.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nahu mhina mhali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Petro ekawesia mzungure ekamuakho hu mhina mhali eekudumuishwa ni Yesu, ekuvaliaha. Ya mhina nihu eezokhodie sina ne Yesu madamo ya viaghu vya chamagheri emlhasue Yesu ekuba, “Dilao niji enekukirii?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Petro aremuakho ka mhina, ekamlhasu Yesu, “Dilao, naya ni kigi mina chinemliiya?” <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu ekamba, “Kai nidumu afufu sari nikurakhwaa, ka mburi teikulhaari. Ari niliaha ani.” <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Kwato ka mburi ikaparaa he vabakhu ite hu mhina tekaga. Mira Yesu tebae ite ka mhina tekaga. U eyoe bi ite “Kai nidumu afufu sari nikuhwaa ka mburi teikulhuaari” <verse eid="JHN 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ka mhina niu eakhoe ya mburi etubaiya naho niu ejigondie ya mburi. Naho nne tureile ite mburi khabuna etubaiya nija kweri.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufiriti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Helo mburi kumure Yesu eboie, kai ka mburi jitegondwa khabuna, teheseekhwa na minda ya kukeiya ka vitabu vigondiwe ka mburi.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>